{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011EQMrhZe7KcqMtH8x27huK","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Gradient narrative死掉——exp-002显示variance structure跨benchmark几乎不变（item_id\n2\t  range仅5.7pp），没有knowledge→reasoning的系统性梯度。必须reframe整篇论文。 新angle：MMLU作为\"case study\n3\t  in multi-facet evaluation measurement\"。 三条Primary contributions： (1) model×item\n4\t  interaction量化——42%→61%的inflation效应 + D-study Δ=0.004 out-of-sample验证，这些数字已锁定（来自actual\n5\t  4-model data），不受exp-002影响； (2) IRT vs G-theory direct comparison——MMLU上3.6-4.4×差异是publishable\n6\t  finding， 但跨benchmark ratio从1.6×到4.1×不等（GSM8K/HellaSwag < 2×），所以\"3-4×\" 只能claim for\n7\t  MMLU，cross-benchmark需说\"benchmark-dependent\"； (3) variance structure benchmark-insensitivity本身reframe为positive：\n8\t  \"practitioners can cautiously extrapolate MMLU-derived budgets to other knowledge\n9\t  benchmarks\"——但D-study cross-bench Δ=0.03-0.06削弱了\"cautiously\"的程度。 Separability完全退出claims降为observation——exp-003（partial）显示hardware×method\n10\t  =4.2% binary，exp-002显示cross-bench separability max=4.8%。 Item resampling instability（CV=0.14）正面spin：item\n11\t  sampling本身就是major variance source，reinforcing G-theory over fixed-benchmark evaluation。\n12\t  Leave-one-model-out matched rerun spread=0.058暴露4-model estimate的fragility， 需要10+模型才能stable——在Discussion中honest报告并标注为limitation。\n13\t  Title改为：\"The Hidden Second Factor: Model×Item Interaction Accounts for 34% of LLM\n14\t  Evaluation Variance\"。 AAAI仍可冲（5-6/10），execution必须完美：writing clean、figures compelling、\n15\t  related work滴水不漏。若AAAI被拒，ACL ARR October有充分时间补实验+扩模型数。\n16\t\n17\t  '\n18\timagined_experiments:\n19\t- name: 'exp-001: Full-scale 4-model MMLU precision study'\n20\t  plan_id: exp-001\n21\t  description: '4 models × 3 precisions × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 orderings\n22\t    × 200 MMLU items。数据已收集完毕（Llama 239,200 + Gemma 172,800 + Mistral 259,200 + Qwen\n23\t    259,200 = 930,400 total records）。Balanced cross-model analysis使用bf16 共享条件：432\n24\t    conditions/model × 4 models × 200 items = 345,600 records。 核心数字已锁定。worst档新增两项robustness分析结果不理想：\n25\t    (a) leave-one-model-out matched-spec rerun显示G_item spread=0.058（>0.05）； (b) BF16-vs-FP16\n26\t    sensitivity已完成确认precision=0.0006%（正面结果）。\n27\t\n28\t    '\n29\t  expected_results:\n30\t    total_records: 930400\n31\t    balanced_cross_model_records: 345600\n32\t    total_conditions: 5184\n33\t    models_completed: 4\n34\t    cross_4model_item_id_pct: 42.1\n35\t    cross_4model_item_id_CI_95:\n36\t    - 36.0\n37\t    - 48.8\n38\t    cross_4model_model_x_item_pct: 33.6\n39\t    cross_4model_model_x_item_CI_95:\n40\t    - 28.4\n41\t    - 37.9\n42\t    cross_4model_G_item: 0.82\n43\t    cross_4model_G_item_CI_95:\n44\t    - 0.782\n45\t    - 0.861\n46\t    d_study_3to4_predicted: 0.816\n47\t    d_study_3to4_actual: 0.82\n48\t    d_study_3to4_delta: 0.004\n49\t    single_model_llama_item_id_pct: 61.1\n50\t    per_model_interaction_mistral_pct: 29.25\n51\t    per_model_interaction_qwen_pct: 27.11\n52\t    per_model_interaction_gemma_pct: 23.95\n53\t    per_model_interaction_llama_pct: 19.69\n54\t    bf16_vs_fp16_precision_pct: 0.0006\n55\t    bf16_vs_fp16_precision_x_item_pct: 0.04\n56\t    infra_x_method_binary_pct: 0.08\n57\t    residual_pct: 19.5\n58\t    lomo_matched_spec_design: bf16 × 4 prompts × 4 seeds × 2 temps × 2 orderings\n59\t    lomo_drop_mistral_G_item: 0.846\n60\t    lomo_drop_qwen_G_item: 0.834\n61\t    lomo_drop_gemma_G_item: 0.802\n62\t    lomo_drop_llama_G_item: 0.788\n63\t    lomo_spread: 0.058\n64\t    lomo_mean_G_item: 0.818\n65\t    lomo_sd_G_item: 0.026\n66\t    d_study_5model_G_item: 0.848\n67\t    d_study_8model_G_item: 0.893\n68\t    d_study_10model_G_item: 0.91\n69\t  result_rationale: '核心cross-model数字已锁定不受worst档影响。worst档的关键问题在leave-one-model-out\n70\t    matched-spec rerun：初始unmatched analysis显示spread=0.023（看起来stable）， 但那是因为不同3-model子集使用了不同条件数（Gemma缺fp16→432\n71\t    conditions/model vs其他648），设计不可比。matched-spec rerun统一使用最大公约数设计 （bf16 × 4 prompts\n72\t    × 4 seeds × 2 temps × 2 orderings = 64 conditions/model）， 条件数大幅减少使得估计精度下降。 Drop-Llama（spread最大端）G_item=0.788，因为Llama是interaction最低的模型\n73\t    （19.69%），去掉它后剩余3模型（Mistral 29.25%、Qwen 27.11%、Gemma 23.95%） 的model×item更大，item\n74\t    difficulty generalizability更差。 Drop-Mistral（spread最小端）G_item=0.846，因为Mistral是interaction最高的模型\n75\t    （29.25%），去掉它反而让剩余3模型的item ranking更一致。 Spread=0.058意味着G_item在[0.788, 0.846]区间内depending\n76\t    on model selection—— reviewer可以argue\"4个模型不够，G_item的point estimate不可靠\"。 但所有4个子集都保持G_item>0.78（>0.75阈值），item_id始终>35%且为最大source，\n77\t    定性结论robust。这个fragility是real的，需要10+模型才能stabilize， 但在论文中可以honest报告并用D-study projection（10\n78\t    models→G=0.910） 来argue方向是对的、只是当前sample不够大。\n79\t\n80\t    '\n81\t  tables:\n82\t  - name: 'Table 1: Cross-model variance decomposition (4 models, MMLU, balanced bf16)'\n83\t    data:\n84\t      columns:\n85\t      - source\n86\t      - pct\n87\t      - CI_lower\n88\t      - CI_upper\n89\t      rows:\n90\t      - - item_id\n91\t        - 42.1\n92\t        - 36.0\n93\t        - 48.8\n94\t      - - model_x_item\n95\t        - 33.6\n96\t        - 28.4\n97\t        - 37.9\n98\t      - - residual\n99\t        - 19.5\n100\t        - 16.2\n101\t        - 23.1\n102\t      - - prompt_x_item\n103\t        - 4.6\n104\t        - 3.1\n105\t        - 6.4\n106\t      - - seed_x_item\n107\t        - 4.7\n108\t        - 3.2\n109\t        - 6.5\n110\t      - - temperature\n111\t        - 1.2\n112\t        - 0.4\n113\t        - 2.3\n114\t      - - model\n115\t        - 0.8\n116\t        - 0.1\n117\t        - 2.1\n118\t      - - precision\n119\t        - 0.0006\n120\t        - 0.0\n121\t        - 0.002\n122\t      - - other_interactions\n123\t        - 0.5\n124\t        - 0.1\n125\t        - 1.2\n126\t  - name: 'Table 2: Leave-one-model-out matched-spec G_item'\n127\t    data:\n128\t      columns:\n129\t      - dropped_model\n130\t      - G_item\n131\t      - item_id_pct\n132\t      - model_x_item_pct\n133\t      rows:\n134\t      - - Mistral\n135\t        - 0.846\n136\t        - 44.8\n137\t        - 28.3\n138\t      - - Qwen\n139\t        - 0.834\n140\t        - 43.2\n141\t        - 30.1\n142\t      - - Gemma\n143\t        - 0.802\n144\t        - 40.5\n145\t        - 35.8\n146\t      - - Llama\n147\t        - 0.788\n148\t        - 39.1\n149\t        - 37.6\n150\t      - - All_4\n151\t        - 0.82\n152\t        - 42.1\n153\t        - 33.6\n154\t  - name: 'Table 3: Per-model single-model variance decomposition'\n155\t    data:\n156\t      columns:\n157\t      - source\n158\t      - llama_pct\n159\t      - gemma_pct\n160\t      - mistral_pct\n161\t      - qwen_pct\n162\t      rows:\n163\t      - - item_id\n164\t        - 61.1\n165\t        - 57.8\n166\t        - 59.4\n167\t        - 55.6\n168\t      - - residual\n169\t        - 17.2\n170\t        - 19.1\n171\t        - 18.4\n172\t        - 20.8\n173\t      - - precision_x_item\n174\t        - 7.2\n175\t        - 7.8\n176\t        - 7.1\n177\t        - 6.5\n178\t      - - prompt_x_item\n179\t        - 4.6\n180\t        - 5.3\n181\t        - 4.9\n182\t        - 6.2\n183\t      - - seed_x_item\n184\t        - 4.7\n185\t        - 4.5\n186\t        - 4.6\n187\t        - 5.1\n188\t      - - temperature_x_item\n189\t        - 3.1\n190\t        - 3.4\n191\t        - 3.2\n192\t        - 3.6\n193\t      - - temperature\n194\t        - 1.2\n195\t        - 1.1\n196\t        - 1.5\n197\t        - 1.2\n198\t      - - precision\n199\t        - 0.5\n200\t        - 0.6\n201\t        - 0.5\n202\t        - 0.7\n203\t  figures_description:\n204\t  - 'Fig 1 (The Reveal): 并排stacked-bar图。左侧single-model（Llama）：item_id 61.1%占据主导，residual\n205\t    17.2%次之。右侧cross-model（4 models）：item_id 缩至42.1%，model×item以33.6%的红色大色块出现为second-largest\n206\t    source， residual微降至19.5%。箭头标注\"19pp absorbed by model×item\"。 视觉效果强烈——明确显示single-model\n207\t    G-study how much overestimates item dominance。\n208\t\n209\t    '\n210\t  - 'Fig 2: Leave-one-model-out G_item waterfall chart。4个子集的G_item从0.788到 0.846，标注spread=0.058。全4-model\n211\t    G_item=0.820用虚线标注。 红色区域标注\"fragility zone\"。\n212\t\n213\t    '\n214\t  analysis: 'exp-001的锁定数字是worst档论文的foundation——model×item=33.6%和D-study Δ=0.004无论其他实验如何都是solid\n215\t    findings。leave-one-model-out matched-spec spread=0.058是worst档的核心concern：它意味着4-model\n216\t    estimate有~3%的standard deviation，reviewer可以argue point estimate不够precise。 Defense策略：(1)\n217\t    所有4个子集都保持qualitative结论（item_id最大，model×item second largest），spread影响的是magnitude不是ranking；(2)\n218\t    D-study projection 清晰显示adding models monotonically improves G_item，当前4-model是under-powered\n219\t    但方向正确；(3) unmatched analysis的spread仅0.023，matched的0.058部分归因于 reduced design（64\n220\t    vs 432 conditions），真实spread可能介于两者之间。 BF16-vs-FP16 sensitivity确认FP32 anomaly是vLLM\n221\t    artifact（positive result）。\n222\t\n223\t    '\n224\t- name: 'exp-001b: Item resampling stability test'\n225\t  plan_id: exp-001b\n226\t  description: '3个独立200-item分层抽样（seeds 0, 7, 99）× Llama × 3 precisions × 3 prompts\n227\t    × 3 seeds × 2 orderings = 54 conditions/sample × 200 items = 10,800 records/sample。\n228\t    Total 32,400 records。在worst档中，CV(item_id)=0.143，显示42%的point estimate 对item sampling敏感。\n229\t\n230\t    '\n231\t  expected_results:\n232\t    total_samples: 3\n233\t    conditions_per_sample: 54\n234\t    records_per_sample: 10800\n235\t    total_records: 32400\n236\t    sample_seed0_item_id_pct: 61.1\n237\t    sample_seed7_item_id_pct: 52.8\n238\t    sample_seed99_item_id_pct: 70.4\n239\t    item_id_mean_pct: 61.4\n240\t    item_id_sd_pct: 8.8\n241\t    item_id_cv: 0.143\n242\t    sample_seed0_G_binary: 0.611\n243\t    sample_seed7_G_binary: 0.536\n244\t    sample_seed99_G_binary: 0.689\n245\t    G_binary_mean: 0.612\n246\t    G_binary_sd: 0.077\n247\t    G_binary_cv: 0.126\n248\t    sample_seed0_residual_pct: 17.2\n249\t    sample_seed7_residual_pct: 23.1\n250\t    sample_seed99_residual_pct: 12.8\n251\t    residual_cv: 0.293\n252\t    variance_ranking_preserved_all_samples: true\n253\t    item_id_always_largest: true\n254\t    profile_corr_seed0_seed7: 0.79\n255\t    profile_corr_seed0_seed99: 0.73\n256\t    profile_corr_seed7_seed99: 0.76\n257\t    avg_profile_corr: 0.76\n258\t  result_rationale: '200 items是MMLU 14,042题的1.4%。即使分层抽样（按57个subjects），每个subject 内的difficulty分布仍有大量变异。seed\n259\t    99抽到更多high-variance subjects （abstract_algebra, formal_logic, professional_medicine——这些subjects的item\n260\t    difficulty range极大，从trivial到near-impossible），导致item间方差膨胀至70.4%。 seed 7则抽到更多\"中等难度集中\"的subjects（high_school_biology,\n261\t    marketing）， item间差异较小，item_id降至52.8%。 CV=0.143意味着单次200-item抽样的item_id%有约14%的相对变异。\n262\t    这不是catastrophic——variance ranking在所有3次抽样中保持（item_id始终最大）， 但足以让reviewer质疑\"42.1%\"这个具体数字。G系数的CV=0.126较低，说明\n263\t    reliability estimate比variance percentage更robust——从0.536到0.689变化较大 但定性判断不变（全部<0.80阈值，需要more\n264\t    items）。 profile correlation平均0.76说明方差结构的shape有moderate一致性， 但不足以claim\"structure\n265\t    is invariant to item sampling\"。 关键defense：把instability本身spin为finding——\"item sampling\n266\t    is itself a major variance source, providing empirical justification for G-theory''s\n267\t    item-as-facet treatment and D-study budgeting approach。\"\n268\t\n269\t    '\n270\t  tables:\n271\t  - name: 'Table 4: Resampling stability across 3 item draws (single-model Llama)'\n272\t    data:\n273\t      columns:\n274\t      - source\n275\t      - seed0_pct\n276\t      - seed7_pct\n277\t      - seed99_pct\n278\t      - mean_pct\n279\t      - sd_pct\n280\t      - cv\n281\t      rows:\n282\t      - - item_id\n283\t        - 61.1\n284\t        - 52.8\n285\t        - 70.4\n286\t        - 61.4\n287\t        - 8.8\n288\t        - 0.143\n289\t      - - residual\n290\t        - 17.2\n291\t        - 23.1\n292\t        - 12.8\n293\t        - 17.7\n294\t        - 5.2\n295\t        - 0.291\n296\t      - - precision_x_item\n297\t        - 7.2\n298\t        - 8.7\n299\t        - 5.6\n300\t        - 7.2\n301\t        - 1.6\n302\t        - 0.217\n303\t      - - prompt_x_item\n304\t        - 4.6\n305\t        - 5.8\n306\t        - 3.9\n307\t        - 4.8\n308\t        - 1.0\n309\t        - 0.201\n310\t      - - seed_x_item\n311\t        - 4.7\n312\t        - 5.2\n313\t        - 4.2\n314\t        - 4.7\n315\t        - 0.5\n316\t        - 0.106\n317\t      - - temperature_x_item\n318\t        - 3.1\n319\t        - 3.3\n320\t        - 2.7\n321\t        - 3.0\n322\t        - 0.3\n323\t        - 0.1\n324\t      - - temperature\n325\t        - 1.2\n326\t        - 1.0\n327\t        - 0.9\n328\t        - 1.0\n329\t        - 0.2\n330\t        - 0.153\n331\t      - - precision\n332\t        - 0.5\n333\t        - 0.6\n334\t        - 0.3\n335\t        - 0.5\n336\t        - 0.2\n337\t        - 0.333\n338\t  - name: 'Table 5: G-coefficient stability across item draws'\n339\t    data:\n340\t      columns:\n341\t      - metric\n342\t      - seed0_G\n343\t      - seed7_G\n344\t      - seed99_G\n345\t      - mean_G\n346\t      - sd_G\n347\t      - cv\n348\t      rows:\n349\t      - - binary\n350\t        - 0.611\n351\t        - 0.536\n352\t        - 0.689\n353\t        - 0.612\n354\t        - 0.077\n355\t        - 0.126\n356\t      - - text_exact\n357\t        - 0.007\n358\t        - 0.005\n359\t        - 0.009\n360\t        - 0.007\n361\t        - 0.002\n362\t        - 0.286\n363\t  figures_description:\n364\t  - 'Fig 3: 三组200-item样本的方差分解并排stacked-bar。item_id始终最大但高度 显著不同（52.8%/61.1%/70.4%）。误差棒标注mean±1SD。右侧小panel显示\n365\t    G-coefficient across samples较为stable（0.536-0.689），标注\"G more robust than variance\n366\t    %\"。\n367\t\n368\t    '\n369\t  analysis: 'CV=0.143直接影响headline claim的precision——论文不能报告\"item_id=42.1%\" 作为definitive\n370\t    number，需要报告\"42.1% [range across item samples: ~36-48%]\"。 但这与bootstrap CI [36.0,\n371\t    48.8]一致，说明resampling instability和statistical uncertainty是同一量级的——bootstrap CI已经captures了item\n372\t    sampling variability。 正面spin：(1) item_id始终是largest source（even at 52.8%远超residual\n373\t    23.1%）， 定性结论robust；(2) resampling instability本身reinforces G-theory的item-as-facet\n374\t    treatment——如果item sampling无关紧要，就不需要G-theory了； (3) G_binary的CV=0.126 < item_id的CV=0.143，reliability比raw\n375\t    variance %更stable。 Reviewer concern \"连自己的estimate都不stable\"可以用\"this is precisely\n376\t    why D-study budgets recommend 500+ items\"来回应。\n377\t\n378\t    '\n379\t- name: 'exp-002: Multi-benchmark replication (flat gradient)'\n380\t  plan_id: exp-002\n381\t  description: '4 models × 2 precisions (bf16/fp16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures\n382\t    (T=0.0/T=0.7) × 4 orderings × 200 items on GSM8K, ARC-Challenge, HellaSwag。 Per\n383\t    benchmark: 4×2×6×6×2×4=2304 conditions × 200 items = 460,800 records。 Total: 1,382,400\n384\t    records。Cross-model balanced analysis: bf16 only, 576 conditions/model × 4 × 200\n385\t    = 230,400/benchmark。 结果：variance structure跨benchmark几乎不变，item_id range仅5.7pp，\n386\t    gradient narrative完全不成立。\n387\t\n388\t    '\n389\t  expected_results:\n390\t    total_records_all_benchmarks: 1382400\n391\t    benchmarks_completed: 3\n392\t    mmlu_cross_item_id_pct: 42.1\n393\t    mmlu_cross_model_x_item_pct: 33.6\n394\t    mmlu_cross_residual_pct: 19.5\n395\t    mmlu_cross_G_item: 0.82\n396\t    gsm8k_cross_item_id_pct: 38.4\n397\t    gsm8k_cross_model_x_item_pct: 31.8\n398\t    gsm8k_cross_residual_pct: 22.6\n399\t    gsm8k_cross_prompt_x_item_pct: 8.4\n400\t    gsm8k_cross_seed_x_item_pct: 5.8\n401\t    gsm8k_cross_temperature_pct: 3.2\n402\t    gsm8k_cross_G_item: 0.682\n403\t    gsm8k_cross_G_binary_200items: 0.438\n404\t    gsm8k_overall_accuracy: 0.512\n405\t    arc_cross_item_id_pct: 44.1\n406\t    arc_cross_model_x_item_pct: 30.5\n407\t    arc_cross_residual_pct: 18.8\n408\t    arc_cross_prompt_x_item_pct: 5.2\n409\t    arc_cross_seed_x_item_pct: 4.6\n410\t    arc_cross_temperature_pct: 1.4\n411\t    arc_cross_G_item: 0.718\n412\t    arc_cross_G_binary_200items: 0.521\n413\t    arc_overall_accuracy: 0.548\n414\t    hellaswag_cross_item_id_pct: 41.8\n415\t    hellaswag_cross_model_x_item_pct: 35.2\n416\t    hellaswag_cross_residual_pct: 17.4\n417\t    hellaswag_cross_prompt_x_item_pct: 3.8\n418\t    hellaswag_cross_seed_x_item_pct: 4.2\n419\t    hellaswag_cross_temperature_pct: 0.8\n420\t    hellaswag_cross_G_item: 0.668\n421\t    hellaswag_cross_G_binary_200items: 0.492\n422\t    hellaswag_overall_accuracy: 0.621\n423\t    cross_bench_item_id_range_pp: 5.7\n424\t    cross_bench_item_id_min: 38.4\n425\t    cross_bench_item_id_max: 44.1\n426\t    cross_bench_model_x_item_range_pp: 4.7\n427\t    gradient_rank_knowledge_to_reasoning: null\n428\t    gradient_linear_fit_R2: 0.12\n429\t    separability_binary_mmlu_pct: 0.08\n430\t    separability_binary_gsm8k_pct: 3.6\n431\t    separability_binary_arc_pct: 2.4\n432\t    separability_binary_hellaswag_pct: 4.8\n433\t    separability_binary_max_pct: 4.8\n434\t    d_study_mmlu_510items_G: 0.8\n435\t    d_study_gsm8k_510items_G: 0.753\n436\t    d_study_arc_510items_G: 0.768\n437\t    d_study_hellaswag_510items_G: 0.742\n438\t    d_study_cross_bench_delta_max: 0.058\n439\t    d_study_cross_bench_delta_min: 0.032\n440\t    d_study_cross_bench_delta_mean: 0.047\n441\t    irt_gtheory_ratio_mmlu: 4.1\n442\t    irt_gtheory_ratio_gsm8k: 1.7\n443\t    irt_gtheory_ratio_arc: 2.5\n444\t    irt_gtheory_ratio_hellaswag: 1.6\n445\t    g_item_cross_bench_min: 0.668\n446\t    g_item_cross_bench_max: 0.82\n447\t    g_item_cross_bench_mean: 0.722\n448\t    mmlu_matched_2x2_item_id_pct: 43.8\n449\t    mmlu_matched_2x2_model_x_item_pct: 32.4\n450\t    mmlu_matched_2x2_delta_from_full: 1.7\n451\t  result_rationale: 'Gradient叙事死掉的核心原因：item_id跨4个benchmark的range仅5.7pp （38.4%-44.1%）。原假设是knowledge\n452\t    benchmarks（MMLU）有高item_id（>55%）， reasoning benchmarks（GSM8K）有低item_id（<30%），形成20+pp的gradient。\n453\t    实际结果是所有benchmark都落在38-44%的狭窄区间内。 为什么flat？model×item交互在所有benchmark上都在30-36%——这意味着无论\n454\t    task type如何，模型间的item difficulty ranking disagreement程度类似。 直觉上，这是因为7-9B模型在knowledge和reasoning\n455\t    tasks上都有类似程度的 model-specific strengths/weaknesses：Llama在MMLU的history和GSM8K的 word\n456\t    problems上都相对strong，Mistral在MMLU的STEM和GSM8K的multi-step上 都相对weak——model-specificity的pattern在task\n457\t    types之间有一致性。 G_item跨benchmark从0.668到0.820变化较大（range=0.152），但这主要由 residual差异驱动而非model×item差异。GSM8K和HellaSwag的G_item低\n458\t    （0.668-0.682）是因为higher residual（22.6%和17.4%+更高的prompt×item）， 不是因为model×item更大。\n459\t    IRT ratio在GSM8K（1.7×）和HellaSwag（1.6×）上collapse到<2×，原因是 这些benchmark的IRT也需要更多items（item\n460\t    discrimination更uniform， 2PL model的efficiency advantage减弱），所以分母增大、ratio压缩。 MMLU上IRT仍然只需~120\n461\t    items因为items有strong discrimination gradients （从trivial到impossible跨57 subjects），2PL拟合效率高。\n462\t    Cross-benchmark separability failure（max=4.8% on HellaSwag binary） 原因：HellaSwag的sentence\n463\t    completion任务对precision和temperature的 交互更敏感——不同precision下temperature>0生成的completions有更多\n464\t    divergence，且binary scoring的粒度在这类任务上captures了更多差异。 D-study cross-bench Δ=0.032-0.058意味着MMLU-derived\n465\t    budgets在其他 benchmark上systematically overestimate reliability by 3-6pp。这是因为 MMLU的residual较低（19.5%）相对于GSM8K（22.6%）——更多unexplained\n466\t    variance意味着需要更多observations来stabilize。\n467\t\n468\t    '\n469\t  tables:\n470\t  - name: 'Table 6: Cross-model variance decomposition by benchmark (4 models, bf16)'\n471\t    data:\n472\t      columns:\n473\t      - source\n474\t      - mmlu_pct\n475\t      - gsm8k_pct\n476\t      - arc_pct\n477\t      - hellaswag_pct\n478\t      - range_pp\n479\t      rows:\n480\t      - - item_id\n481\t        - 42.1\n482\t        - 38.4\n483\t        - 44.1\n484\t        - 41.8\n485\t        - 5.7\n486\t      - - model_x_item\n487\t        - 33.6\n488\t        - 31.8\n489\t        - 30.5\n490\t        - 35.2\n491\t        - 4.7\n492\t      - - residual\n493\t        - 19.5\n494\t        - 22.6\n495\t        - 18.8\n496\t        - 17.4\n497\t        - 5.2\n498\t      - - prompt_x_item\n499\t        - 4.6\n500\t        - 8.4\n501\t        - 5.2\n502\t        - 3.8\n503\t        - 4.6\n504\t      - - seed_x_item\n505\t        - 4.7\n506\t        - 5.8\n507\t        - 4.6\n508\t        - 4.2\n509\t        - 1.6\n510\t      - - temperature\n511\t        - 1.2\n512\t        - 3.2\n513\t        - 1.4\n514\t        - 0.8\n515\t        - 2.4\n516\t      - - model\n517\t        - 0.8\n518\t        - 1.2\n519\t        - 0.9\n520\t        - 0.6\n521\t        - 0.6\n522\t      - - precision\n523\t        - 0.0006\n524\t        - 0.3\n525\t        - 0.1\n526\t        - 0.2\n527\t        - 0.3\n528\t  - name: 'Table 7: G_item and IRT comparison by benchmark'\n529\t    data:\n530\t      columns:\n531\t      - benchmark\n532\t      - G_item_4model\n533\t      - G_binary_200items\n534\t      - irt_items_needed\n535\t      - gtheory_items_G80\n536\t      - ratio\n537\t      rows:\n538\t      - - MMLU\n539\t        - 0.82\n540\t        - 0.611\n541\t        - 118\n542\t        - 510\n543\t        - 4.1\n544\t      - - GSM8K\n545\t        - 0.682\n546\t        - 0.438\n547\t        - 286\n548\t        - 486\n549\t        - 1.7\n550\t      - - ARC-Challenge\n551\t        - 0.718\n552\t        - 0.521\n553\t        - 178\n554\t        - 448\n555\t        - 2.5\n556\t      - - HellaSwag\n557\t        - 0.668\n558\t        - 0.492\n559\t        - 312\n560\t        - 502\n561\t        - 1.6\n562\t  - name: 'Table 8: Cross-benchmark separability (binary, precision×methodology interaction)'\n563\t    data:\n564\t      columns:\n565\t      - benchmark\n566\t      - prec_x_prompt_pct\n567\t      - prec_x_seed_pct\n568\t      - prec_x_temp_pct\n569\t      - total_infra_x_method_pct\n570\t      rows:\n571\t      - - MMLU\n572\t        - 0.02\n573\t        - 0.01\n574\t        - 0.05\n575\t        - 0.08\n576\t      - - GSM8K\n577\t        - 1.2\n578\t        - 0.8\n579\t        - 1.6\n580\t        - 3.6\n581\t      - - ARC-Challenge\n582\t        - 0.9\n583\t        - 0.5\n584\t        - 1.0\n585\t        - 2.4\n586\t      - - HellaSwag\n587\t        - 1.6\n588\t        - 1.1\n589\t        - 2.1\n590\t        - 4.8\n591\t  - name: 'Table 9: D-study cross-benchmark transfer error'\n592\t    data:\n593\t      columns:\n594\t      - benchmark\n595\t      - mmlu_derived_G_at_510items\n596\t      - actual_G_at_510items\n597\t      - delta\n598\t      rows:\n599\t      - - MMLU\n600\t        - 0.8\n601\t        - 0.8\n602\t        - 0.0\n603\t      - - GSM8K\n604\t        - 0.8\n605\t        - 0.753\n606\t        - 0.047\n607\t      - - ARC-Challenge\n608\t        - 0.8\n609\t        - 0.768\n610\t        - 0.032\n611\t      - - HellaSwag\n612\t        - 0.8\n613\t        - 0.742\n614\t        - 0.058\n615\t  figures_description:\n616\t  - 'Fig 4: 4-benchmark stacked-bar variance decomposition。所有bars几乎等高的 item_id（38-44%）和model×item（30-35%），视觉上immediately\n617\t    conveys\"flat\"。 与原计划的\"gradient reveals\"图截然不同——现在是\"uniformity reveals\"。 标注range=5.7pp和\"no\n618\t    systematic gradient\"。\n619\t\n620\t    '\n621\t  - 'Fig 5: Scatter plot of IRT items vs G-theory items per benchmark。MMLU在 右上角（IRT\n622\t    118, G-theory 510, ratio 4.1×），GSM8K和HellaSwag在左下 （ratio ~1.6-1.7×）。1:1 line和2×\n623\t    line标注。显示ratio的benchmark-dependence。\n624\t\n625\t    '\n626\t  analysis: 'exp-002是worst档叙事转向的关键实验。gradient死亡意味着原planned的 \"cross-benchmark variance\n627\t    gradient — the primary novel finding\"完全不可用。 但flat structure本身可以reframe： (1) Positive\n628\t    spin：\"variance structure is approximately benchmark-invariant\" → practitioners可以用MMLU结果cautiously\n629\t    extrapolate to other benchmarks。 这解决了一个practical question。 (2) D-study transfer\n630\t    error（Δ=0.03-0.06）限定了\"cautiously\"的程度—— MMLU-derived budgets会在其他benchmark上overestimate\n631\t    G by 3-6pp， 需要add 10-15% safety margin。 (3) IRT ratio的benchmark-dependence（1.6×-4.1×）是一个publishable\n632\t    finding 本身——解释了为什么field对\"IRT够不够\"的争论不收敛：答案是benchmark-dependent。 Separability failure\n633\t    across benchmarks（MMLU 0.08% vs HellaSwag 4.8%） means separability完全不能作为general\n634\t    claim，降为\"observed on MMLU under binary scoring; does not hold generally\"。 Net\n635\t    assessment: exp-002的data是有价值的，只是不支撑原叙事。reframe后 可以支撑contribution (3)（benchmark-insensitivity\n636\t    as positive）但forcing function是writing quality——flat results需要更skillful framing。\n637\t\n638\t    '\n639\t- name: 'exp-003: Multi-hardware G-study (partial)'\n640\t  plan_id: exp-003\n641\t  description: '原计划4 models × 2+ GPU types × 2 precisions × full crossing。 在worst档中，第二种GPU（RTX\n642\t    A6000 48GB）在deadline前4周获得， 仅完成2 models（Llama + Mistral）× 2 precisions（bf16/fp16）×\n643\t    6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 orderings × 200 items = 2 × 576 × 200 = 230,400\n644\t    records。 Hardware × methodology interaction = 4.2% binary average，separability\n645\t    claim破裂。\n646\t\n647\t    '\n648\t  expected_results:\n649\t    status: PARTIAL\n650\t    gpu_types:\n651\t    - RTX_PRO_6000_96GB\n652\t    - RTX_A6000_48GB\n653\t    models_completed: 2\n654\t    models:\n655\t    - Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct\n656\t    - Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3\n657\t    total_records: 230400\n658\t    conditions_per_model: 576\n659\t    hardware_main_effect_pct: 1.8\n660\t    hardware_x_precision_pct: 0.9\n661\t    hardware_x_prompt_pct: 0.6\n662\t    hardware_x_seed_pct: 0.3\n663\t    hardware_x_temperature_pct: 1.4\n664\t    hardware_x_item_pct: 2.8\n665\t    total_hardware_x_methodology_pct: 4.2\n666\t    hardware_x_methodology_llama_pct: 3.8\n667\t    hardware_x_methodology_mistral_pct: 4.6\n668\t    single_gpu_infra_x_method_pct: 0.08\n669\t    multi_gpu_infra_x_method_pct: 4.2\n670\t    delta_pp: 4.12\n671\t    llama_pro6000_accuracy: 0.6814\n672\t    llama_a6000_accuracy: 0.6791\n673\t    llama_hardware_gap_pp: 0.23\n674\t    mistral_pro6000_accuracy: 0.6124\n675\t    mistral_a6000_accuracy: 0.6083\n676\t    mistral_hardware_gap_pp: 0.41\n677\t    G_binary_single_gpu: 0.611\n678\t    G_binary_two_gpu: 0.582\n679\t    G_delta: 0.029\n680\t  result_rationale: 'Hardware×methodology interaction从single-GPU的0.08%跳至multi-GPU的4.2%，\n681\t    原因是两种GPU有不同的CUDA kernel implementations（RTX PRO 6000使用 sm_89 Ada Lovelace kernels，A6000使用sm_86\n682\t    Ampere kernels）。 BF16 matrix multiply的rounding behavior在两种架构上不同——不是precision 本身的问题（bf16\n683\t    spec相同），而是kernel-level implementation差异导致 少量items在一个GPU上答对、另一个上答错。 hardware×temperature=1.4%是最大sub-interaction，因为temperature>0时的\n684\t    sampling受CUDA RNG implementation影响，不同GPU的cuRAND版本产生 不同的pseudo-random sequences（即使seed相同）。\n685\t    hardware×item=2.8%反映了~5-8个items在两GPU间有consistently不同的 答案——这些items恰好在model的decision\n686\t    boundary上，kernel-level numerical differences足以flip prediction。 Mistral（4.6%）比Llama（3.8%）的hardware\n687\t    interaction更大，因为Mistral accuracy更低（61.2%），更多items在decision boundary附近。 这个结果对separability是definitive\n688\t    negative：\"infrastructure×methodology ≈0%\"只在single-GPU上成立。跨GPU，interaction是non-negligible的。\n689\t    但4.2%仍然是minor relative to item_id（42.1%）和model×item（33.6%）， 所以the hierarchy is\n690\t    preserved——hardware interaction doesn''t dominate。\n691\t\n692\t    '\n693\t  tables:\n694\t  - name: 'Table 10: Hardware × methodology interaction breakdown (2 models, binary)'\n695\t    data:\n696\t      columns:\n697\t      - interaction_term\n698\t      - llama_pct\n699\t      - mistral_pct\n700\t      - average_pct\n701\t      rows:\n702\t      - - hardware_x_temperature\n703\t        - 1.1\n704\t        - 1.7\n705\t        - 1.4\n706\t      - - hardware_x_precision\n707\t        - 0.7\n708\t        - 1.1\n709\t        - 0.9\n710\t      - - hardware_x_prompt\n711\t        - 0.5\n712\t        - 0.7\n713\t        - 0.6\n714\t      - - hardware_x_seed\n715\t        - 0.2\n716\t        - 0.4\n717\t        - 0.3\n718\t      - - hardware_x_item\n719\t        - 2.4\n720\t        - 3.2\n721\t        - 2.8\n722\t      - - hardware_main\n723\t        - 1.3\n724\t        - 2.3\n725\t        - 1.8\n726\t      - - total_hardware_related\n727\t        - 6.2\n728\t        - 9.4\n729\t        - 7.8\n730\t      - - total_hardware_x_methodology\n731\t        - 3.8\n732\t        - 4.6\n733\t        - 4.2\n734\t  figures_description:\n735\t  - 'Fig (appendix): 双GPU variance decomposition stacked-bar。item_id仍dominant （~40%），但hardware-related\n736\t    components合计7.8%，以橙色系标注。 hardware×methodology=4.2%用红色标注并与single-GPU的0.08%对比。\n737\t\n738\t    '\n739\t  analysis: 'exp-003的partial completion足以kill separability claim但不够做full hardware\n740\t    G-study。只有2个模型意味着hardware×model interaction无法properly estimate。 但data is sufficient\n741\t    to downgrade separability from \"claim\" to \"observation limited to single-GPU environments\"。\n742\t    论文framing：在Methods中honest报告\"hardware crossing was partially completed (2 of 4\n743\t    models)\"，在Results中报告4.2% interaction as \"preliminary evidence that separability\n744\t    does not hold across GPU architectures\"，在Discussion中 qualify all prior separability\n745\t    statements to \"single-GPU, single-architecture\"。 这不fatal——separability在worst档叙事中已经不是contribution了。\n746\t\n747\t    '\n748\t- name: 'exp-004: Comprehensive analysis'\n749\t  plan_id: exp-004\n750\t  description: '基于exp-001/001b/002/003数据的全面分析。Worst档中exp-003仅有partial data， 但exp-001和exp-002完整。可执行13/17\n751\t    planned analyses。 核心输出：IRT vs G-theory对比（benchmark-dependent ratio），D-study cross-benchmark\n752\t    transfer analysis，完整robustness package。\n753\t\n754\t    '\n755\t  expected_results:\n756\t    planned_analyses: 17\n757\t    executable_analyses: 13\n758\t    blocked_analyses: 4\n759\t    blocked_list:\n760\t    - full hardware G-study\n761\t    - hardware ranking stability\n762\t    - hardware logprob analysis\n763\t    - hardware cost optimization\n764\t    model_as_facet_item_id_pct: 42.1\n765\t    model_as_facet_model_x_item_pct: 33.6\n766\t    model_as_facet_G_item: 0.82\n767\t    bootstrap_n: 1000\n768\t    item_id_CI_95:\n769\t    - 36.0\n770\t    - 48.8\n771\t    model_x_item_CI_95:\n772\t    - 28.4\n773\t    - 37.9\n774\t    residual_CI_95:\n775\t    - 16.2\n776\t    - 23.1\n777\t    G_item_CI_95:\n778\t    - 0.782\n779\t    - 0.861\n780\t    G_binary_CI_95:\n781\t    - 0.571\n782\t    - 0.652\n783\t    d_study_practical_items_G80_mmlu: 510\n784\t    d_study_practical_items_G80_gsm8k: 624\n785\t    d_study_practical_items_G80_arc: 538\n786\t    d_study_practical_items_G80_hellaswag: 652\n787\t    d_study_cross_bench_delta_range:\n788\t    - 0.032\n789\t    - 0.058\n790\t    d_study_14k_mmlu_G: 0.972\n791\t    reml_henderson_max_diff_pp: 0.4\n792\t    reml_convergence_iterations: 500\n793\t    reml_practical_convergence_delta: 0.003\n794\t    irt_gtheory_ratio_mmlu: 4.1\n795\t    irt_gtheory_ratio_gsm8k: 1.7\n796\t    irt_gtheory_ratio_arc: 2.5\n797\t    irt_gtheory_ratio_hellaswag: 1.6\n798\t    irt_gtheory_ratio_mean: 2.5\n799\t    irt_gtheory_ratio_sd: 1.14\n800\t    min_detectable_interaction_pct: 0.8\n801\t    power_at_1pct_interaction: 0.94\n802\t    power_at_5pct_interaction: 0.99\n803\t    G_all_random: 0.611\n804\t    G_temp_fixed: 0.634\n805\t    G_ordering_fixed: 0.645\n806\t    G_both_fixed: 0.664\n807\t    fixed_random_max_delta: 0.053\n808\t    bernoulli_obs_variance_corr: 0.91\n809\t    null_sim_item_id_pct: 0.08\n810\t    obs_to_bernoulli_ratio: 1.0008\n811\t    bootstrap_jackknife_CI_ratio_mean: 1.02\n812\t    bootstrap_jackknife_CI_ratio_range:\n813\t    - 0.96\n814\t    - 1.04\n815\t    mmlu_2x2_vs_3x3_max_delta_pp: 1.7\n816\t    mmlu_14k_items_G_projected: 0.972\n817\t    logprob_mmlu_item_id_pct: 48.3\n818\t    logprob_gsm8k_item_id_pct: 44.8\n819\t    logprob_arc_item_id_pct: 46.1\n820\t    logprob_hellaswag_item_id_pct: 45.9\n821\t    logprob_cross_bench_range_pp: 3.5\n822\t    gpu_hours_G80_mmlu: 340\n823\t    gpu_hours_G80_gsm8k: 415\n824\t    gpu_hours_G80_hellaswag: 430\n825\t    gpu_hours_G90_mmlu: 890\n826\t  result_rationale: 'exp-004的analysis在worst档中产出两类结果： (1) Robust surviving findings（不受数据缺失影响）：IRT\n827\t    vs G-theory对比 在MMLU上4.1×（locked），但cross-benchmark显示ratio从1.6×到4.1×—— reviewer会说\"so\n828\t    the 3-4× claim is only valid for MMLU\"。ratio collapse的 原因：在reasoning benchmarks上，IRT的2PL\n829\t    model fit效率降低（items have 更uniform discrimination，lower slope parameters），IRT自己也需要更多items\n830\t    （GSM8K: 286 items vs MMLU: 118 items），所以G-theory的extra cost 相对缩小。论文可以claim \"3.6-4.4×\n831\t    on MMLU\" and \"1.6-4.1× benchmark- dependent range\"——后者本身是informative finding。\n832\t    (2) Weakened findings：D-study cross-benchmark transfer Δ=0.03-0.06 意味着MMLU budgets不能直接apply\n833\t    to other benchmarks（会high by 3-6pp G）。 这undercuts contribution (3)的\"practitioners\n834\t    can extrapolate\"——需要加 significant caveat \"with 10-15% safety margin\"。 Robustness\n835\t    package全部基于exp-001 Llama数据，fully intact：binary not artifact（null sim 0.08%），fixed\n836\t    vs random insensitive（Δ<0.053）， bootstrap=jackknife（ratio 0.96-1.04），REML confirms\n837\t    Henderson I（<0.4pp）。 这些是论文的guaranteed floor——无论worst scenario多bad，robustness is\n838\t    there。 Logprob analysis跨benchmarks显示更tight的range（3.5pp vs binary的5.7pp）， suggesting\n839\t    logprob-based scoring reduces benchmark-dependence。This is a minor but novel observation\n840\t    that can go in Discussion。\n841\t\n842\t    '\n843\t  tables:\n844\t  - name: 'Table 11: IRT vs G-theory item requirements by benchmark'\n845\t    data:\n846\t      columns:\n847\t      - benchmark\n848\t      - irt_2pl_items\n849\t      - gtheory_practical_items\n850\t      - ratio\n851\t      - gtheory_accounts_for\n852\t      rows:\n853\t      - - MMLU\n854\t        - 118\n855\t        - 510\n856\t        - 4.1\n857\t        - prompt + seed + ordering + temp + prec\n858\t      - - GSM8K\n859\t        - 286\n860\t        - 486\n861\t        - 1.7\n862\t        - same facets; IRT also needs more items\n863\t      - - ARC-Challenge\n864\t        - 178\n865\t        - 448\n866\t        - 2.5\n867\t        - same\n868\t      - - HellaSwag\n869\t        - 312\n870\t        - 502\n871\t        - 1.6\n872\t        - same; IRT needs most items here\n873\t  - name: 'Table 12: D-study budget recommendations by benchmark (G≥0.80, practical)'\n874\t    data:\n875\t      columns:\n876\t      - benchmark\n877\t      - items\n878\t      - prompts\n879\t      - seeds\n880\t      - G_projected\n881\t      - CI_95\n882\t      rows:\n883\t      - - MMLU\n884\t        - 510\n885\t        - 2\n886\t        - 3\n887\t        - 0.8\n888\t        - '[0.782, 0.825]'\n889\t      - - GSM8K\n890\t        - 624\n891\t        - 3\n892\t        - 4\n893\t        - 0.801\n894\t        - '[0.774, 0.831]'\n895\t      - - ARC-Challenge\n896\t        - 538\n897\t        - 2\n898\t        - 3\n899\t        - 0.8\n900\t        - '[0.778, 0.826]'\n901\t      - - HellaSwag\n902\t        - 652\n903\t        - 3\n904\t        - 4\n905\t        - 0.802\n906\t        - '[0.771, 0.838]'\n907\t  - name: 'Table 13: Methodological robustness summary'\n908\t    data:\n909\t      columns:\n910\t      - analysis\n911\t      - result\n912\t      - status\n913\t      rows:\n914\t      - - Binary not artifact (null sim)\n915\t        - item_id=0.08% vs obs 61.1% (737×)\n916\t        - PASS\n917\t      - - Fixed vs random sensitivity\n918\t        - max Δ(G)=0.053\n919\t        - PASS\n920\t      - - Bootstrap = Jackknife CIs\n921\t        - ratio range [0.96, 1.04]\n922\t        - PASS\n923\t      - - REML vs Henderson I\n924\t        - max diff < 0.4pp\n925\t        - PASS\n926\t      - - Temperature stratification\n927\t        - 'binary G: 0.760→0.549 (T=0→0.7)'\n928\t        - PASS\n929\t      - - Bernoulli variance correlation\n930\t        - r=0.91 (item variance partly mechanical)\n931\t        - NOTED\n932\t      - - D-study cross-benchmark transfer\n933\t        - Δ=0.032-0.058\n934\t        - CAVEAT\n935\t      - - Leave-one-model-out matched\n936\t        - spread=0.058\n937\t        - CAVEAT\n938\t  figures_description:\n939\t  - 'Fig 6: D-study projection curves per benchmark。4条curves（MMLU/GSM8K/ARC/ HellaSwag），x轴item\n940\t    count，y轴G coefficient。G≥0.80 threshold line。 MMLU curve最陡（510 items达标），HellaSwag最缓（652\n941\t    items）。 IRT curves叠加显示（虚线），MMLU上gap大（4.1×），HellaSwag上gap小（1.6×）。\n942\t\n943\t    '\n944\t  - 'Fig 7: Temperature-stratified G heatmap。4 benchmarks × 3 temperatures （T=0.0/0.3/0.7）×\n945\t    2 metrics（binary/text-exact）。Binary从上到下 degradation monotonic。Text-exact全黑（<0.01）。Cross-benchmark\n946\t    pattern similar（supporting \"structure is approximately invariant\"）。\n947\t\n948\t    '\n949\t  analysis: 'exp-004在worst档中的关键产出是benchmark-conditional IRT ratio——这是 新发现，解释了field对\"IRT够不够\"的长期争论。可以claim：\"The\n950\t    IRT-G-theory gap is benchmark-dependent, ranging from 1.6× (HellaSwag) to 4.1×\n951\t    (MMLU), because IRT item parameters (discrimination, difficulty) vary across task\n952\t    types\"。这不需要gradient叙事，是self-contained的。 D-study cross-benchmark transfer analysis（Δ=0.03-0.06）is\n953\t    nuanced： 正面解读是MMLU budgets are \"approximately right\" (within 6pp G)； 负面解读是they''re\n954\t    \"not directly transferable\"。论文adopt中间立场： \"MMLU-derived budgets provide a lower\n955\t    bound; benchmark-specific calibration improves precision by 3-6pp G\"。 Robustness\n956\t    package的6个PASS + 2个CAVEAT provides methodological credibility。 CAVEAT items (D-study\n957\t    transfer, LOMO) are discussed honestly rather than hidden。\n958\t\n959\t    '\n960\t- name: 'exp-005: 14B model extension'\n961\t  plan_id: exp-005\n962\t  description: 'Qwen3-14B和DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B在datacenter GPU上的BF16/FP16测试。 Worst档中未执行——deps\n963\t    on exp-003 timeline + 无可用48GB+ GPU时间。\n964\t\n965\t    '\n966\t  expected_results:\n967\t    status: NOT_COMPLETED\n968\t    records_collected: 0\n969\t    blocking_reason: 'exp-003在deadline前4周才partially完成，exp-005的protocol 依赖exp-003确定的multi-hardware\n970\t      procedure。同时14B模型需要 ~24GB VRAM（bf16），PRO 6000可以跑但被P0实验占满。 无法在AAAI deadline前执行。\n971\t\n972\t      '\n973\t  result_rationale: 'exp-005的timeline依赖链：exp-003 partial completion → protocol finalization\n974\t    → 14B model runs。exp-003在T-4周才完成，来不及做exp-005的full crossing。 此外，14B模型的inference\n975\t    latency比8B高~1.8×，即使有GPU也难在deadline内 完成576 conditions × 2 models × 200 items =\n976\t    230,400 records。 对论文的影响：所有结论限于7-9B模型规模。reviewer concern \"scale validation\" 只能在Limitations中acknowledge，argue\n977\t    \"7-9B是最commonly used open-weight model class\"。\n978\t\n979\t    '\n980\t  tables: []\n981\t  figures_description: []\n982\t  analysis: '不fatal。论文scope明确为\"7-9B open-weight models\"。14B extension 适合ACL ARR camera-ready或后续独立paper。\n983\t\n984\t    '\n985\t- name: 'exp-006: Fine-tuning G-study'\n986\t  plan_id: exp-006\n987\t  description: 'RoBERTa-large在SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA上的fine-tuning方差分解。 Worst档中未执行——P1优先级，GPU\n988\t    budget被P0消耗。\n989\t\n990\t    '\n991\t  expected_results:\n992\t    status: NOT_COMPLETED\n993\t    records_collected: 0\n994\t    blocking_reason: 'P1 priority。P0实验（exp-001 ~100h + exp-002 ~200h + exp-003 ~60h\n995\t      partial） 消耗了大部分GPU budget。1,728次fine-tuning runs × ~15min ≈ 430 GPU-hours 无法accommodate。\n996\t\n997\t      '\n998\t  result_rationale: 'Per D006 framing directive #5，fine-tuning已降级为Discussion-section\n999\t    preliminary observation，不是numbered contribution。即使完成，encoder-only RoBERTa的fine-tuning与decoder\n1000\t    LLM inference的methodological gap也会被 reviewer指出。在worst档reframed narrative（MMLU\n1001\t    case study + IRT comparison） 中，fine-tuning完全outside scope。\n1002\t\n1003\t    '\n1004\t  tables: []\n1005\t  figures_description: []\n1006\t  analysis: '零影响。在Discussion中mention \"extending G-theory to fine-tuning variance is\n1007\t    natural future work; Dodge et al. (2020) and Bui et al. (2025) provide preliminary\n1008\t    evidence that seed/LR dominate fine-tuning variance\"。\n1009\t\n1010\t    '\n1011\t- name: 'exp-007: LayerCast precision mitigation'\n1012\t  plan_id: exp-007\n1013\t  description: 'LayerCast（FP16 storage + FP32 compute）作为额外precision条件。 P2优先级，worst档中未执行。\n1014\t\n1015\t    '\n1016\t  expected_results:\n1017\t    status: NOT_COMPLETED\n1018\t    records_collected: 0\n1019\t    blocking_reason: P2 priority, not attempted within AAAI timeline\n1020\t  result_rationale: 'LayerCast是mitigation strategy evaluation，不是core finding。 BF16-vs-FP16\n1021\t    sensitivity已显示precision effect=0.0006%（接近zero）， LayerCast的additional data point价值marginal——precision已经不是\n1022\t    variance source。可以在Discussion中cite Yuan et al. (2025)的 LayerCast results as \"practitioners\n1023\t    can further reduce precision variance via mixed-precision strategies\"。\n1024\t\n1025\t    '\n1026\t  tables: []\n1027\t  figures_description: []\n1028\t  analysis: '零影响。Precision在bf16/fp16上已经是non-issue（0.0006%）， LayerCast实验变得moot。\n1029\t\n1030\t    '\n1031\t- name: 'exp-008: MATH benchmark extension'\n1032\t  plan_id: exp-008\n1033\t  description: 'MATH benchmark（200 items）测试reasoning-heavy任务的variance structure。 P2优先级且deps\n1034\t    on exp-002，worst档中未执行。\n1035\t\n1036\t    '\n1037\t  expected_results:\n1038\t    status: NOT_COMPLETED\n1039\t    records_collected: 0\n1040\t    blocking_reason: 'P2 priority。Deps on exp-002 pipeline（已完成但consumed timeline）。\n1041\t      MATH的chain-of-thought generation需要significantly longer inference time （avg ~45\n1042\t      tokens vs MMLU ~1 token），200h GPU budget已用尽。\n1043\t\n1044\t      '\n1045\t  result_rationale: 'exp-002已经覆盖了GSM8K（math reasoning）、ARC（science reasoning）、 HellaSwag（commonsense），增加MATH的marginal\n1046\t    value在worst档flat gradient 下更低——不会出现新pattern，只会是another data point在38-44% item_id区间内。\n1047\t    如果需要bolster \"benchmark-insensitivity\" claim，现有4个benchmarks （MMLU + 3 from exp-002）已经sufficient。\n1048\t\n1049\t    '\n1050\t  tables: []\n1051\t  figures_description: []\n1052\t  analysis: Marginal impact。4个benchmarks showing flat structure已经支撑 \"benchmark-insensitivity\"\n1053\t    reframe。MATH would be 5th data point but not change the conclusion。适合ACL ARR补充。\n1054\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"891f265c-8c20-445c-964a-94d66c0b1d82","uuid":"00729ef4-1d3c-47c4-9493-deb886151054","timestamp":"2026-05-21T08:46:51.930Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519/projects/nlp_variance_gtheory/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T075006/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Gradient narrative死掉——exp-002显示variance structure跨benchmark几乎不变（item_id\n  range仅5.7pp），没有knowledge→reasoning的系统性梯度。必须reframe整篇论文。 新angle：MMLU作为\"case study\n  in multi-facet evaluation measurement\"。 三条Primary contributions： (1) model×item\n  interaction量化——42%→61%的inflation效应 + D-study Δ=0.004 out-of-sample验证，这些数字已锁定（来自actual\n  4-model data），不受exp-002影响； (2) IRT vs G-theory direct comparison——MMLU上3.6-4.4×差异是publishable\n  finding， 但跨benchmark ratio从1.6×到4.1×不等（GSM8K/HellaSwag < 2×），所以\"3-4×\" 只能claim for\n  MMLU，cross-benchmark需说\"benchmark-dependent\"； (3) variance structure benchmark-insensitivity本身reframe为positive：\n  \"practitioners can cautiously extrapolate MMLU-derived budgets to other knowledge\n  benchmarks\"——但D-study cross-bench Δ=0.03-0.06削弱了\"cautiously\"的程度。 Separability完全退出claims降为observation——exp-003（partial）显示hardware×method\n  =4.2% binary，exp-002显示cross-bench separability max=4.8%。 Item resampling instability（CV=0.14）正面spin：item\n  sampling本身就是major variance source，reinforcing G-theory over fixed-benchmark evaluation。\n  Leave-one-model-out matched rerun spread=0.058暴露4-model estimate的fragility， 需要10+模型才能stable——在Discussion中honest报告并标注为limitation。\n  Title改为：\"The Hidden Second Factor: Model×Item Interaction Accounts for 34% of LLM\n  Evaluation Variance\"。 AAAI仍可冲（5-6/10），execution必须完美：writing clean、figures compelling、\n  related work滴水不漏。若AAAI被拒，ACL ARR October有充分时间补实验+扩模型数。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: 'exp-001: Full-scale 4-model MMLU precision study'\n  plan_id: exp-001\n  description: '4 models × 3 precisions × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 orderings\n    × 200 MMLU items。数据已收集完毕（Llama 239,200 + Gemma 172,800 + Mistral 259,200 + Qwen\n    259,200 = 930,400 total records）。Balanced cross-model analysis使用bf16 共享条件：432\n    conditions/model × 4 models × 200 items = 345,600 records。 核心数字已锁定。worst档新增两项robustness分析结果不理想：\n    (a) leave-one-model-out matched-spec rerun显示G_item spread=0.058（>0.05）； (b) BF16-vs-FP16\n    sensitivity已完成确认precision=0.0006%（正面结果）。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records: 930400\n    balanced_cross_model_records: 345600\n    total_conditions: 5184\n    models_completed: 4\n    cross_4model_item_id_pct: 42.1\n    cross_4model_item_id_CI_95:\n    - 36.0\n    - 48.8\n    cross_4model_model_x_item_pct: 33.6\n    cross_4model_model_x_item_CI_95:\n    - 28.4\n    - 37.9\n    cross_4model_G_item: 0.82\n    cross_4model_G_item_CI_95:\n    - 0.782\n    - 0.861\n    d_study_3to4_predicted: 0.816\n    d_study_3to4_actual: 0.82\n    d_study_3to4_delta: 0.004\n    single_model_llama_item_id_pct: 61.1\n    per_model_interaction_mistral_pct: 29.25\n    per_model_interaction_qwen_pct: 27.11\n    per_model_interaction_gemma_pct: 23.95\n    per_model_interaction_llama_pct: 19.69\n    bf16_vs_fp16_precision_pct: 0.0006\n    bf16_vs_fp16_precision_x_item_pct: 0.04\n    infra_x_method_binary_pct: 0.08\n    residual_pct: 19.5\n    lomo_matched_spec_design: bf16 × 4 prompts × 4 seeds × 2 temps × 2 orderings\n    lomo_drop_mistral_G_item: 0.846\n    lomo_drop_qwen_G_item: 0.834\n    lomo_drop_gemma_G_item: 0.802\n    lomo_drop_llama_G_item: 0.788\n    lomo_spread: 0.058\n    lomo_mean_G_item: 0.818\n    lomo_sd_G_item: 0.026\n    d_study_5model_G_item: 0.848\n    d_study_8model_G_item: 0.893\n    d_study_10model_G_item: 0.91\n  result_rationale: '核心cross-model数字已锁定不受worst档影响。worst档的关键问题在leave-one-model-out\n    matched-spec rerun：初始unmatched analysis显示spread=0.023（看起来stable）， 但那是因为不同3-model子集使用了不同条件数（Gemma缺fp16→432\n    conditions/model vs其他648），设计不可比。matched-spec rerun统一使用最大公约数设计 （bf16 × 4 prompts\n    × 4 seeds × 2 temps × 2 orderings = 64 conditions/model）， 条件数大幅减少使得估计精度下降。 Drop-Llama（spread最大端）G_item=0.788，因为Llama是interaction最低的模型\n    （19.69%），去掉它后剩余3模型（Mistral 29.25%、Qwen 27.11%、Gemma 23.95%） 的model×item更大，item\n    difficulty generalizability更差。 Drop-Mistral（spread最小端）G_item=0.846，因为Mistral是interaction最高的模型\n    （29.25%），去掉它反而让剩余3模型的item ranking更一致。 Spread=0.058意味着G_item在[0.788, 0.846]区间内depending\n    on model selection—— reviewer可以argue\"4个模型不够，G_item的point estimate不可靠\"。 但所有4个子集都保持G_item>0.78（>0.75阈值），item_id始终>35%且为最大source，\n    定性结论robust。这个fragility是real的，需要10+模型才能stabilize， 但在论文中可以honest报告并用D-study projection（10\n    models→G=0.910） 来argue方向是对的、只是当前sample不够大。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: Cross-model variance decomposition (4 models, MMLU, balanced bf16)'\n    data:\n      columns:\n      - source\n      - pct\n      - CI_lower\n      - CI_upper\n      rows:\n      - - item_id\n        - 42.1\n        - 36.0\n        - 48.8\n      - - model_x_item\n        - 33.6\n        - 28.4\n        - 37.9\n      - - residual\n        - 19.5\n        - 16.2\n        - 23.1\n      - - prompt_x_item\n        - 4.6\n        - 3.1\n        - 6.4\n      - - seed_x_item\n        - 4.7\n        - 3.2\n        - 6.5\n      - - temperature\n        - 1.2\n        - 0.4\n        - 2.3\n      - - model\n        - 0.8\n        - 0.1\n        - 2.1\n      - - precision\n        - 0.0006\n        - 0.0\n        - 0.002\n      - - other_interactions\n        - 0.5\n        - 0.1\n        - 1.2\n  - name: 'Table 2: Leave-one-model-out matched-spec G_item'\n    data:\n      columns:\n      - dropped_model\n      - G_item\n      - item_id_pct\n      - model_x_item_pct\n      rows:\n      - - Mistral\n        - 0.846\n        - 44.8\n        - 28.3\n      - - Qwen\n        - 0.834\n        - 43.2\n        - 30.1\n      - - Gemma\n        - 0.802\n        - 40.5\n        - 35.8\n      - - Llama\n        - 0.788\n        - 39.1\n        - 37.6\n      - - All_4\n        - 0.82\n        - 42.1\n        - 33.6\n  - name: 'Table 3: Per-model single-model variance decomposition'\n    data:\n      columns:\n      - source\n      - llama_pct\n      - gemma_pct\n      - mistral_pct\n      - qwen_pct\n      rows:\n      - - item_id\n        - 61.1\n        - 57.8\n        - 59.4\n        - 55.6\n      - - residual\n        - 17.2\n        - 19.1\n        - 18.4\n        - 20.8\n      - - precision_x_item\n        - 7.2\n        - 7.8\n        - 7.1\n        - 6.5\n      - - prompt_x_item\n        - 4.6\n        - 5.3\n        - 4.9\n        - 6.2\n      - - seed_x_item\n        - 4.7\n        - 4.5\n        - 4.6\n        - 5.1\n      - - temperature_x_item\n        - 3.1\n        - 3.4\n        - 3.2\n        - 3.6\n      - - temperature\n        - 1.2\n        - 1.1\n        - 1.5\n        - 1.2\n      - - precision\n        - 0.5\n        - 0.6\n        - 0.5\n        - 0.7\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 1 (The Reveal): 并排stacked-bar图。左侧single-model（Llama）：item_id 61.1%占据主导，residual\n    17.2%次之。右侧cross-model（4 models）：item_id 缩至42.1%，model×item以33.6%的红色大色块出现为second-largest\n    source， residual微降至19.5%。箭头标注\"19pp absorbed by model×item\"。 视觉效果强烈——明确显示single-model\n    G-study how much overestimates item dominance。\n\n    '\n  - 'Fig 2: Leave-one-model-out G_item waterfall chart。4个子集的G_item从0.788到 0.846，标注spread=0.058。全4-model\n    G_item=0.820用虚线标注。 红色区域标注\"fragility zone\"。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'exp-001的锁定数字是worst档论文的foundation——model×item=33.6%和D-study Δ=0.004无论其他实验如何都是solid\n    findings。leave-one-model-out matched-spec spread=0.058是worst档的核心concern：它意味着4-model\n    estimate有~3%的standard deviation，reviewer可以argue point estimate不够precise。 Defense策略：(1)\n    所有4个子集都保持qualitative结论（item_id最大，model×item second largest），spread影响的是magnitude不是ranking；(2)\n    D-study projection 清晰显示adding models monotonically improves G_item，当前4-model是under-powered\n    但方向正确；(3) unmatched analysis的spread仅0.023，matched的0.058部分归因于 reduced design（64\n    vs 432 conditions），真实spread可能介于两者之间。 BF16-vs-FP16 sensitivity确认FP32 anomaly是vLLM\n    artifact（positive result）。\n\n    '\n- name: 'exp-001b: Item resampling stability test'\n  plan_id: exp-001b\n  description: '3个独立200-item分层抽样（seeds 0, 7, 99）× Llama × 3 precisions × 3 prompts\n    × 3 seeds × 2 orderings = 54 conditions/sample × 200 items = 10,800 records/sample。\n    Total 32,400 records。在worst档中，CV(item_id)=0.143，显示42%的point estimate 对item sampling敏感。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_samples: 3\n    conditions_per_sample: 54\n    records_per_sample: 10800\n    total_records: 32400\n    sample_seed0_item_id_pct: 61.1\n    sample_seed7_item_id_pct: 52.8\n    sample_seed99_item_id_pct: 70.4\n    item_id_mean_pct: 61.4\n    item_id_sd_pct: 8.8\n    item_id_cv: 0.143\n    sample_seed0_G_binary: 0.611\n    sample_seed7_G_binary: 0.536\n    sample_seed99_G_binary: 0.689\n    G_binary_mean: 0.612\n    G_binary_sd: 0.077\n    G_binary_cv: 0.126\n    sample_seed0_residual_pct: 17.2\n    sample_seed7_residual_pct: 23.1\n    sample_seed99_residual_pct: 12.8\n    residual_cv: 0.293\n    variance_ranking_preserved_all_samples: true\n    item_id_always_largest: true\n    profile_corr_seed0_seed7: 0.79\n    profile_corr_seed0_seed99: 0.73\n    profile_corr_seed7_seed99: 0.76\n    avg_profile_corr: 0.76\n  result_rationale: '200 items是MMLU 14,042题的1.4%。即使分层抽样（按57个subjects），每个subject 内的difficulty分布仍有大量变异。seed\n    99抽到更多high-variance subjects （abstract_algebra, formal_logic, professional_medicine——这些subjects的item\n    difficulty range极大，从trivial到near-impossible），导致item间方差膨胀至70.4%。 seed 7则抽到更多\"中等难度集中\"的subjects（high_school_biology,\n    marketing）， item间差异较小，item_id降至52.8%。 CV=0.143意味着单次200-item抽样的item_id%有约14%的相对变异。\n    这不是catastrophic——variance ranking在所有3次抽样中保持（item_id始终最大）， 但足以让reviewer质疑\"42.1%\"这个具体数字。G系数的CV=0.126较低，说明\n    reliability estimate比variance percentage更robust——从0.536到0.689变化较大 但定性判断不变（全部<0.80阈值，需要more\n    items）。 profile correlation平均0.76说明方差结构的shape有moderate一致性， 但不足以claim\"structure\n    is invariant to item sampling\"。 关键defense：把instability本身spin为finding——\"item sampling\n    is itself a major variance source, providing empirical justification for G-theory''s\n    item-as-facet treatment and D-study budgeting approach。\"\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 4: Resampling stability across 3 item draws (single-model Llama)'\n    data:\n      columns:\n      - source\n      - seed0_pct\n      - seed7_pct\n      - seed99_pct\n      - mean_pct\n      - sd_pct\n      - cv\n      rows:\n      - - item_id\n        - 61.1\n        - 52.8\n        - 70.4\n        - 61.4\n        - 8.8\n        - 0.143\n      - - residual\n        - 17.2\n        - 23.1\n        - 12.8\n        - 17.7\n        - 5.2\n        - 0.291\n      - - precision_x_item\n        - 7.2\n        - 8.7\n        - 5.6\n        - 7.2\n        - 1.6\n        - 0.217\n      - - prompt_x_item\n        - 4.6\n        - 5.8\n        - 3.9\n        - 4.8\n        - 1.0\n        - 0.201\n      - - seed_x_item\n        - 4.7\n        - 5.2\n        - 4.2\n        - 4.7\n        - 0.5\n        - 0.106\n      - - temperature_x_item\n        - 3.1\n        - 3.3\n        - 2.7\n        - 3.0\n        - 0.3\n        - 0.1\n      - - temperature\n        - 1.2\n        - 1.0\n        - 0.9\n        - 1.0\n        - 0.2\n        - 0.153\n      - - precision\n        - 0.5\n        - 0.6\n        - 0.3\n        - 0.5\n        - 0.2\n        - 0.333\n  - name: 'Table 5: G-coefficient stability across item draws'\n    data:\n      columns:\n      - metric\n      - seed0_G\n      - seed7_G\n      - seed99_G\n      - mean_G\n      - sd_G\n      - cv\n      rows:\n      - - binary\n        - 0.611\n        - 0.536\n        - 0.689\n        - 0.612\n        - 0.077\n        - 0.126\n      - - text_exact\n        - 0.007\n        - 0.005\n        - 0.009\n        - 0.007\n        - 0.002\n        - 0.286\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 3: 三组200-item样本的方差分解并排stacked-bar。item_id始终最大但高度 显著不同（52.8%/61.1%/70.4%）。误差棒标注mean±1SD。右侧小panel显示\n    G-coefficient across samples较为stable（0.536-0.689），标注\"G more robust than variance\n    %\"。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'CV=0.143直接影响headline claim的precision——论文不能报告\"item_id=42.1%\" 作为definitive\n    number，需要报告\"42.1% [range across item samples: ~36-48%]\"。 但这与bootstrap CI [36.0,\n    48.8]一致，说明resampling instability和statistical uncertainty是同一量级的——bootstrap CI已经captures了item\n    sampling variability。 正面spin：(1) item_id始终是largest source（even at 52.8%远超residual\n    23.1%）， 定性结论robust；(2) resampling instability本身reinforces G-theory的item-as-facet\n    treatment——如果item sampling无关紧要，就不需要G-theory了； (3) G_binary的CV=0.126 < item_id的CV=0.143，reliability比raw\n    variance %更stable。 Reviewer concern \"连自己的estimate都不stable\"可以用\"this is precisely\n    why D-study budgets recommend 500+ items\"来回应。\n\n    '\n- name: 'exp-002: Multi-benchmark replication (flat gradient)'\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: '4 models × 2 precisions (bf16/fp16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures\n    (T=0.0/T=0.7) × 4 orderings × 200 items on GSM8K, ARC-Challenge, HellaSwag。 Per\n    benchmark: 4×2×6×6×2×4=2304 conditions × 200 items = 460,800 records。 Total: 1,382,400\n    records。Cross-model balanced analysis: bf16 only, 576 conditions/model × 4 × 200\n    = 230,400/benchmark。 结果：variance structure跨benchmark几乎不变，item_id range仅5.7pp，\n    gradient narrative完全不成立。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records_all_benchmarks: 1382400\n    benchmarks_completed: 3\n    mmlu_cross_item_id_pct: 42.1\n    mmlu_cross_model_x_item_pct: 33.6\n    mmlu_cross_residual_pct: 19.5\n    mmlu_cross_G_item: 0.82\n    gsm8k_cross_item_id_pct: 38.4\n    gsm8k_cross_model_x_item_pct: 31.8\n    gsm8k_cross_residual_pct: 22.6\n    gsm8k_cross_prompt_x_item_pct: 8.4\n    gsm8k_cross_seed_x_item_pct: 5.8\n    gsm8k_cross_temperature_pct: 3.2\n    gsm8k_cross_G_item: 0.682\n    gsm8k_cross_G_binary_200items: 0.438\n    gsm8k_overall_accuracy: 0.512\n    arc_cross_item_id_pct: 44.1\n    arc_cross_model_x_item_pct: 30.5\n    arc_cross_residual_pct: 18.8\n    arc_cross_prompt_x_item_pct: 5.2\n    arc_cross_seed_x_item_pct: 4.6\n    arc_cross_temperature_pct: 1.4\n    arc_cross_G_item: 0.718\n    arc_cross_G_binary_200items: 0.521\n    arc_overall_accuracy: 0.548\n    hellaswag_cross_item_id_pct: 41.8\n    hellaswag_cross_model_x_item_pct: 35.2\n    hellaswag_cross_residual_pct: 17.4\n    hellaswag_cross_prompt_x_item_pct: 3.8\n    hellaswag_cross_seed_x_item_pct: 4.2\n    hellaswag_cross_temperature_pct: 0.8\n    hellaswag_cross_G_item: 0.668\n    hellaswag_cross_G_binary_200items: 0.492\n    hellaswag_overall_accuracy: 0.621\n    cross_bench_item_id_range_pp: 5.7\n    cross_bench_item_id_min: 38.4\n    cross_bench_item_id_max: 44.1\n    cross_bench_model_x_item_range_pp: 4.7\n    gradient_rank_knowledge_to_reasoning: null\n    gradient_linear_fit_R2: 0.12\n    separability_binary_mmlu_pct: 0.08\n    separability_binary_gsm8k_pct: 3.6\n    separability_binary_arc_pct: 2.4\n    separability_binary_hellaswag_pct: 4.8\n    separability_binary_max_pct: 4.8\n    d_study_mmlu_510items_G: 0.8\n    d_study_gsm8k_510items_G: 0.753\n    d_study_arc_510items_G: 0.768\n    d_study_hellaswag_510items_G: 0.742\n    d_study_cross_bench_delta_max: 0.058\n    d_study_cross_bench_delta_min: 0.032\n    d_study_cross_bench_delta_mean: 0.047\n    irt_gtheory_ratio_mmlu: 4.1\n    irt_gtheory_ratio_gsm8k: 1.7\n    irt_gtheory_ratio_arc: 2.5\n    irt_gtheory_ratio_hellaswag: 1.6\n    g_item_cross_bench_min: 0.668\n    g_item_cross_bench_max: 0.82\n    g_item_cross_bench_mean: 0.722\n    mmlu_matched_2x2_item_id_pct: 43.8\n    mmlu_matched_2x2_model_x_item_pct: 32.4\n    mmlu_matched_2x2_delta_from_full: 1.7\n  result_rationale: 'Gradient叙事死掉的核心原因：item_id跨4个benchmark的range仅5.7pp （38.4%-44.1%）。原假设是knowledge\n    benchmarks（MMLU）有高item_id（>55%）， reasoning benchmarks（GSM8K）有低item_id（<30%），形成20+pp的gradient。\n    实际结果是所有benchmark都落在38-44%的狭窄区间内。 为什么flat？model×item交互在所有benchmark上都在30-36%——这意味着无论\n    task type如何，模型间的item difficulty ranking disagreement程度类似。 直觉上，这是因为7-9B模型在knowledge和reasoning\n    tasks上都有类似程度的 model-specific strengths/weaknesses：Llama在MMLU的history和GSM8K的 word\n    problems上都相对strong，Mistral在MMLU的STEM和GSM8K的multi-step上 都相对weak——model-specificity的pattern在task\n    types之间有一致性。 G_item跨benchmark从0.668到0.820变化较大（range=0.152），但这主要由 residual差异驱动而非model×item差异。GSM8K和HellaSwag的G_item低\n    （0.668-0.682）是因为higher residual（22.6%和17.4%+更高的prompt×item）， 不是因为model×item更大。\n    IRT ratio在GSM8K（1.7×）和HellaSwag（1.6×）上collapse到<2×，原因是 这些benchmark的IRT也需要更多items（item\n    discrimination更uniform， 2PL model的efficiency advantage减弱），所以分母增大、ratio压缩。 MMLU上IRT仍然只需~120\n    items因为items有strong discrimination gradients （从trivial到impossible跨57 subjects），2PL拟合效率高。\n    Cross-benchmark separability failure（max=4.8% on HellaSwag binary） 原因：HellaSwag的sentence\n    completion任务对precision和temperature的 交互更敏感——不同precision下temperature>0生成的completions有更多\n    divergence，且binary scoring的粒度在这类任务上captures了更多差异。 D-study cross-bench Δ=0.032-0.058意味着MMLU-derived\n    budgets在其他 benchmark上systematically overestimate reliability by 3-6pp。这是因为 MMLU的residual较低（19.5%）相对于GSM8K（22.6%）——更多unexplained\n    variance意味着需要更多observations来stabilize。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 6: Cross-model variance decomposition by benchmark (4 models, bf16)'\n    data:\n      columns:\n      - source\n      - mmlu_pct\n      - gsm8k_pct\n      - arc_pct\n      - hellaswag_pct\n      - range_pp\n      rows:\n      - - item_id\n        - 42.1\n        - 38.4\n        - 44.1\n        - 41.8\n        - 5.7\n      - - model_x_item\n        - 33.6\n        - 31.8\n        - 30.5\n        - 35.2\n        - 4.7\n      - - residual\n        - 19.5\n        - 22.6\n        - 18.8\n        - 17.4\n        - 5.2\n      - - prompt_x_item\n        - 4.6\n        - 8.4\n        - 5.2\n        - 3.8\n        - 4.6\n      - - seed_x_item\n        - 4.7\n        - 5.8\n        - 4.6\n        - 4.2\n        - 1.6\n      - - temperature\n        - 1.2\n        - 3.2\n        - 1.4\n        - 0.8\n        - 2.4\n      - - model\n        - 0.8\n        - 1.2\n        - 0.9\n        - 0.6\n        - 0.6\n      - - precision\n        - 0.0006\n        - 0.3\n        - 0.1\n        - 0.2\n        - 0.3\n  - name: 'Table 7: G_item and IRT comparison by benchmark'\n    data:\n      columns:\n      - benchmark\n      - G_item_4model\n      - G_binary_200items\n      - irt_items_needed\n      - gtheory_items_G80\n      - ratio\n      rows:\n      - - MMLU\n        - 0.82\n        - 0.611\n        - 118\n        - 510\n        - 4.1\n      - - GSM8K\n        - 0.682\n        - 0.438\n        - 286\n        - 486\n        - 1.7\n      - - ARC-Challenge\n        - 0.718\n        - 0.521\n        - 178\n        - 448\n        - 2.5\n      - - HellaSwag\n        - 0.668\n        - 0.492\n        - 312\n        - 502\n        - 1.6\n  - name: 'Table 8: Cross-benchmark separability (binary, precision×methodology interaction)'\n    data:\n      columns:\n      - benchmark\n      - prec_x_prompt_pct\n      - prec_x_seed_pct\n      - prec_x_temp_pct\n      - total_infra_x_method_pct\n      rows:\n      - - MMLU\n        - 0.02\n        - 0.01\n        - 0.05\n        - 0.08\n      - - GSM8K\n        - 1.2\n        - 0.8\n        - 1.6\n        - 3.6\n      - - ARC-Challenge\n        - 0.9\n        - 0.5\n        - 1.0\n        - 2.4\n      - - HellaSwag\n        - 1.6\n        - 1.1\n        - 2.1\n        - 4.8\n  - name: 'Table 9: D-study cross-benchmark transfer error'\n    data:\n      columns:\n      - benchmark\n      - mmlu_derived_G_at_510items\n      - actual_G_at_510items\n      - delta\n      rows:\n      - - MMLU\n        - 0.8\n        - 0.8\n        - 0.0\n      - - GSM8K\n        - 0.8\n        - 0.753\n        - 0.047\n      - - ARC-Challenge\n        - 0.8\n        - 0.768\n        - 0.032\n      - - HellaSwag\n        - 0.8\n        - 0.742\n        - 0.058\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 4: 4-benchmark stacked-bar variance decomposition。所有bars几乎等高的 item_id（38-44%）和model×item（30-35%），视觉上immediately\n    conveys\"flat\"。 与原计划的\"gradient reveals\"图截然不同——现在是\"uniformity reveals\"。 标注range=5.7pp和\"no\n    systematic gradient\"。\n\n    '\n  - 'Fig 5: Scatter plot of IRT items vs G-theory items per benchmark。MMLU在 右上角（IRT\n    118, G-theory 510, ratio 4.1×），GSM8K和HellaSwag在左下 （ratio ~1.6-1.7×）。1:1 line和2×\n    line标注。显示ratio的benchmark-dependence。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'exp-002是worst档叙事转向的关键实验。gradient死亡意味着原planned的 \"cross-benchmark variance\n    gradient — the primary novel finding\"完全不可用。 但flat structure本身可以reframe： (1) Positive\n    spin：\"variance structure is approximately benchmark-invariant\" → practitioners可以用MMLU结果cautiously\n    extrapolate to other benchmarks。 这解决了一个practical question。 (2) D-study transfer\n    error（Δ=0.03-0.06）限定了\"cautiously\"的程度—— MMLU-derived budgets会在其他benchmark上overestimate\n    G by 3-6pp， 需要add 10-15% safety margin。 (3) IRT ratio的benchmark-dependence（1.6×-4.1×）是一个publishable\n    finding 本身——解释了为什么field对\"IRT够不够\"的争论不收敛：答案是benchmark-dependent。 Separability failure\n    across benchmarks（MMLU 0.08% vs HellaSwag 4.8%） means separability完全不能作为general\n    claim，降为\"observed on MMLU under binary scoring; does not hold generally\"。 Net\n    assessment: exp-002的data是有价值的，只是不支撑原叙事。reframe后 可以支撑contribution (3)（benchmark-insensitivity\n    as positive）但forcing function是writing quality——flat results需要更skillful framing。\n\n    '\n- name: 'exp-003: Multi-hardware G-study (partial)'\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: '原计划4 models × 2+ GPU types × 2 precisions × full crossing。 在worst档中，第二种GPU（RTX\n    A6000 48GB）在deadline前4周获得， 仅完成2 models（Llama + Mistral）× 2 precisions（bf16/fp16）×\n    6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 orderings × 200 items = 2 × 576 × 200 = 230,400\n    records。 Hardware × methodology interaction = 4.2% binary average，separability\n    claim破裂。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: PARTIAL\n    gpu_types:\n    - RTX_PRO_6000_96GB\n    - RTX_A6000_48GB\n    models_completed: 2\n    models:\n    - Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct\n    - Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3\n    total_records: 230400\n    conditions_per_model: 576\n    hardware_main_effect_pct: 1.8\n    hardware_x_precision_pct: 0.9\n    hardware_x_prompt_pct: 0.6\n    hardware_x_seed_pct: 0.3\n    hardware_x_temperature_pct: 1.4\n    hardware_x_item_pct: 2.8\n    total_hardware_x_methodology_pct: 4.2\n    hardware_x_methodology_llama_pct: 3.8\n    hardware_x_methodology_mistral_pct: 4.6\n    single_gpu_infra_x_method_pct: 0.08\n    multi_gpu_infra_x_method_pct: 4.2\n    delta_pp: 4.12\n    llama_pro6000_accuracy: 0.6814\n    llama_a6000_accuracy: 0.6791\n    llama_hardware_gap_pp: 0.23\n    mistral_pro6000_accuracy: 0.6124\n    mistral_a6000_accuracy: 0.6083\n    mistral_hardware_gap_pp: 0.41\n    G_binary_single_gpu: 0.611\n    G_binary_two_gpu: 0.582\n    G_delta: 0.029\n  result_rationale: 'Hardware×methodology interaction从single-GPU的0.08%跳至multi-GPU的4.2%，\n    原因是两种GPU有不同的CUDA kernel implementations（RTX PRO 6000使用 sm_89 Ada Lovelace kernels，A6000使用sm_86\n    Ampere kernels）。 BF16 matrix multiply的rounding behavior在两种架构上不同——不是precision 本身的问题（bf16\n    spec相同），而是kernel-level implementation差异导致 少量items在一个GPU上答对、另一个上答错。 hardware×temperature=1.4%是最大sub-interaction，因为temperature>0时的\n    sampling受CUDA RNG implementation影响，不同GPU的cuRAND版本产生 不同的pseudo-random sequences（即使seed相同）。\n    hardware×item=2.8%反映了~5-8个items在两GPU间有consistently不同的 答案——这些items恰好在model的decision\n    boundary上，kernel-level numerical differences足以flip prediction。 Mistral（4.6%）比Llama（3.8%）的hardware\n    interaction更大，因为Mistral accuracy更低（61.2%），更多items在decision boundary附近。 这个结果对separability是definitive\n    negative：\"infrastructure×methodology ≈0%\"只在single-GPU上成立。跨GPU，interaction是non-negligible的。\n    但4.2%仍然是minor relative to item_id（42.1%）和model×item（33.6%）， 所以the hierarchy is\n    preserved——hardware interaction doesn''t dominate。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 10: Hardware × methodology interaction breakdown (2 models, binary)'\n    data:\n      columns:\n      - interaction_term\n      - llama_pct\n      - mistral_pct\n      - average_pct\n      rows:\n      - - hardware_x_temperature\n        - 1.1\n        - 1.7\n        - 1.4\n      - - hardware_x_precision\n        - 0.7\n        - 1.1\n        - 0.9\n      - - hardware_x_prompt\n        - 0.5\n        - 0.7\n        - 0.6\n      - - hardware_x_seed\n        - 0.2\n        - 0.4\n        - 0.3\n      - - hardware_x_item\n        - 2.4\n        - 3.2\n        - 2.8\n      - - hardware_main\n        - 1.3\n        - 2.3\n        - 1.8\n      - - total_hardware_related\n        - 6.2\n        - 9.4\n        - 7.8\n      - - total_hardware_x_methodology\n        - 3.8\n        - 4.6\n        - 4.2\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig (appendix): 双GPU variance decomposition stacked-bar。item_id仍dominant （~40%），但hardware-related\n    components合计7.8%，以橙色系标注。 hardware×methodology=4.2%用红色标注并与single-GPU的0.08%对比。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'exp-003的partial completion足以kill separability claim但不够做full hardware\n    G-study。只有2个模型意味着hardware×model interaction无法properly estimate。 但data is sufficient\n    to downgrade separability from \"claim\" to \"observation limited to single-GPU environments\"。\n    论文framing：在Methods中honest报告\"hardware crossing was partially completed (2 of 4\n    models)\"，在Results中报告4.2% interaction as \"preliminary evidence that separability\n    does not hold across GPU architectures\"，在Discussion中 qualify all prior separability\n    statements to \"single-GPU, single-architecture\"。 这不fatal——separability在worst档叙事中已经不是contribution了。\n\n    '\n- name: 'exp-004: Comprehensive analysis'\n  plan_id: exp-004\n  description: '基于exp-001/001b/002/003数据的全面分析。Worst档中exp-003仅有partial data， 但exp-001和exp-002完整。可执行13/17\n    planned analyses。 核心输出：IRT vs G-theory对比（benchmark-dependent ratio），D-study cross-benchmark\n    transfer analysis，完整robustness package。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    planned_analyses: 17\n    executable_analyses: 13\n    blocked_analyses: 4\n    blocked_list:\n    - full hardware G-study\n    - hardware ranking stability\n    - hardware logprob analysis\n    - hardware cost optimization\n    model_as_facet_item_id_pct: 42.1\n    model_as_facet_model_x_item_pct: 33.6\n    model_as_facet_G_item: 0.82\n    bootstrap_n: 1000\n    item_id_CI_95:\n    - 36.0\n    - 48.8\n    model_x_item_CI_95:\n    - 28.4\n    - 37.9\n    residual_CI_95:\n    - 16.2\n    - 23.1\n    G_item_CI_95:\n    - 0.782\n    - 0.861\n    G_binary_CI_95:\n    - 0.571\n    - 0.652\n    d_study_practical_items_G80_mmlu: 510\n    d_study_practical_items_G80_gsm8k: 624\n    d_study_practical_items_G80_arc: 538\n    d_study_practical_items_G80_hellaswag: 652\n    d_study_cross_bench_delta_range:\n    - 0.032\n    - 0.058\n    d_study_14k_mmlu_G: 0.972\n    reml_henderson_max_diff_pp: 0.4\n    reml_convergence_iterations: 500\n    reml_practical_convergence_delta: 0.003\n    irt_gtheory_ratio_mmlu: 4.1\n    irt_gtheory_ratio_gsm8k: 1.7\n    irt_gtheory_ratio_arc: 2.5\n    irt_gtheory_ratio_hellaswag: 1.6\n    irt_gtheory_ratio_mean: 2.5\n    irt_gtheory_ratio_sd: 1.14\n    min_detectable_interaction_pct: 0.8\n    power_at_1pct_interaction: 0.94\n    power_at_5pct_interaction: 0.99\n    G_all_random: 0.611\n    G_temp_fixed: 0.634\n    G_ordering_fixed: 0.645\n    G_both_fixed: 0.664\n    fixed_random_max_delta: 0.053\n    bernoulli_obs_variance_corr: 0.91\n    null_sim_item_id_pct: 0.08\n    obs_to_bernoulli_ratio: 1.0008\n    bootstrap_jackknife_CI_ratio_mean: 1.02\n    bootstrap_jackknife_CI_ratio_range:\n    - 0.96\n    - 1.04\n    mmlu_2x2_vs_3x3_max_delta_pp: 1.7\n    mmlu_14k_items_G_projected: 0.972\n    logprob_mmlu_item_id_pct: 48.3\n    logprob_gsm8k_item_id_pct: 44.8\n    logprob_arc_item_id_pct: 46.1\n    logprob_hellaswag_item_id_pct: 45.9\n    logprob_cross_bench_range_pp: 3.5\n    gpu_hours_G80_mmlu: 340\n    gpu_hours_G80_gsm8k: 415\n    gpu_hours_G80_hellaswag: 430\n    gpu_hours_G90_mmlu: 890\n  result_rationale: 'exp-004的analysis在worst档中产出两类结果： (1) Robust surviving findings（不受数据缺失影响）：IRT\n    vs G-theory对比 在MMLU上4.1×（locked），但cross-benchmark显示ratio从1.6×到4.1×—— reviewer会说\"so\n    the 3-4× claim is only valid for MMLU\"。ratio collapse的 原因：在reasoning benchmarks上，IRT的2PL\n    model fit效率降低（items have 更uniform discrimination，lower slope parameters），IRT自己也需要更多items\n    （GSM8K: 286 items vs MMLU: 118 items），所以G-theory的extra cost 相对缩小。论文可以claim \"3.6-4.4×\n    on MMLU\" and \"1.6-4.1× benchmark- dependent range\"——后者本身是informative finding。\n    (2) Weakened findings：D-study cross-benchmark transfer Δ=0.03-0.06 意味着MMLU budgets不能直接apply\n    to other benchmarks（会high by 3-6pp G）。 这undercuts contribution (3)的\"practitioners\n    can extrapolate\"——需要加 significant caveat \"with 10-15% safety margin\"。 Robustness\n    package全部基于exp-001 Llama数据，fully intact：binary not artifact（null sim 0.08%），fixed\n    vs random insensitive（Δ<0.053）， bootstrap=jackknife（ratio 0.96-1.04），REML confirms\n    Henderson I（<0.4pp）。 这些是论文的guaranteed floor——无论worst scenario多bad，robustness is\n    there。 Logprob analysis跨benchmarks显示更tight的range（3.5pp vs binary的5.7pp）， suggesting\n    logprob-based scoring reduces benchmark-dependence。This is a minor but novel observation\n    that can go in Discussion。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 11: IRT vs G-theory item requirements by benchmark'\n    data:\n      columns:\n      - benchmark\n      - irt_2pl_items\n      - gtheory_practical_items\n      - ratio\n      - gtheory_accounts_for\n      rows:\n      - - MMLU\n        - 118\n        - 510\n        - 4.1\n        - prompt + seed + ordering + temp + prec\n      - - GSM8K\n        - 286\n        - 486\n        - 1.7\n        - same facets; IRT also needs more items\n      - - ARC-Challenge\n        - 178\n        - 448\n        - 2.5\n        - same\n      - - HellaSwag\n        - 312\n        - 502\n        - 1.6\n        - same; IRT needs most items here\n  - name: 'Table 12: D-study budget recommendations by benchmark (G≥0.80, practical)'\n    data:\n      columns:\n      - benchmark\n      - items\n      - prompts\n      - seeds\n      - G_projected\n      - CI_95\n      rows:\n      - - MMLU\n        - 510\n        - 2\n        - 3\n        - 0.8\n        - '[0.782, 0.825]'\n      - - GSM8K\n        - 624\n        - 3\n        - 4\n        - 0.801\n        - '[0.774, 0.831]'\n      - - ARC-Challenge\n        - 538\n        - 2\n        - 3\n        - 0.8\n        - '[0.778, 0.826]'\n      - - HellaSwag\n        - 652\n        - 3\n        - 4\n        - 0.802\n        - '[0.771, 0.838]'\n  - name: 'Table 13: Methodological robustness summary'\n    data:\n      columns:\n      - analysis\n      - result\n      - status\n      rows:\n      - - Binary not artifact (null sim)\n        - item_id=0.08% vs obs 61.1% (737×)\n        - PASS\n      - - Fixed vs random sensitivity\n        - max Δ(G)=0.053\n        - PASS\n      - - Bootstrap = Jackknife CIs\n        - ratio range [0.96, 1.04]\n        - PASS\n      - - REML vs Henderson I\n        - max diff < 0.4pp\n        - PASS\n      - - Temperature stratification\n        - 'binary G: 0.760→0.549 (T=0→0.7)'\n        - PASS\n      - - Bernoulli variance correlation\n        - r=0.91 (item variance partly mechanical)\n        - NOTED\n      - - D-study cross-benchmark transfer\n        - Δ=0.032-0.058\n        - CAVEAT\n      - - Leave-one-model-out matched\n        - spread=0.058\n        - CAVEAT\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 6: D-study projection curves per benchmark。4条curves（MMLU/GSM8K/ARC/ HellaSwag），x轴item\n    count，y轴G coefficient。G≥0.80 threshold line。 MMLU curve最陡（510 items达标），HellaSwag最缓（652\n    items）。 IRT curves叠加显示（虚线），MMLU上gap大（4.1×），HellaSwag上gap小（1.6×）。\n\n    '\n  - 'Fig 7: Temperature-stratified G heatmap。4 benchmarks × 3 temperatures （T=0.0/0.3/0.7）×\n    2 metrics（binary/text-exact）。Binary从上到下 degradation monotonic。Text-exact全黑（<0.01）。Cross-benchmark\n    pattern similar（supporting \"structure is approximately invariant\"）。\n\n    '\n  analysis: 'exp-004在worst档中的关键产出是benchmark-conditional IRT ratio——这是 新发现，解释了field对\"IRT够不够\"的长期争论。可以claim：\"The\n    IRT-G-theory gap is benchmark-dependent, ranging from 1.6× (HellaSwag) to 4.1×\n    (MMLU), because IRT item parameters (discrimination, difficulty) vary across task\n    types\"。这不需要gradient叙事，是self-contained的。 D-study cross-benchmark transfer analysis（Δ=0.03-0.06）is\n    nuanced： 正面解读是MMLU budgets are \"approximately right\" (within 6pp G)； 负面解读是they''re\n    \"not directly transferable\"。论文adopt中间立场： \"MMLU-derived budgets provide a lower\n    bound; benchmark-specific calibration improves precision by 3-6pp G\"。 Robustness\n    package的6个PASS + 2个CAVEAT provides methodological credibility。 CAVEAT items (D-study\n    transfer, LOMO) are discussed honestly rather than hidden。\n\n    '\n- name: 'exp-005: 14B model extension'\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: 'Qwen3-14B和DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B在datacenter GPU上的BF16/FP16测试。 Worst档中未执行——deps\n    on exp-003 timeline + 无可用48GB+ GPU时间。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: NOT_COMPLETED\n    records_collected: 0\n    blocking_reason: 'exp-003在deadline前4周才partially完成，exp-005的protocol 依赖exp-003确定的multi-hardware\n      procedure。同时14B模型需要 ~24GB VRAM（bf16），PRO 6000可以跑但被P0实验占满。 无法在AAAI deadline前执行。\n\n      '\n  result_rationale: 'exp-005的timeline依赖链：exp-003 partial completion → protocol finalization\n    → 14B model runs。exp-003在T-4周才完成，来不及做exp-005的full crossing。 此外，14B模型的inference\n    latency比8B高~1.8×，即使有GPU也难在deadline内 完成576 conditions × 2 models × 200 items =\n    230,400 records。 对论文的影响：所有结论限于7-9B模型规模。reviewer concern \"scale validation\" 只能在Limitations中acknowledge，argue\n    \"7-9B是最commonly used open-weight model class\"。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '不fatal。论文scope明确为\"7-9B open-weight models\"。14B extension 适合ACL ARR camera-ready或后续独立paper。\n\n    '\n- name: 'exp-006: Fine-tuning G-study'\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: 'RoBERTa-large在SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA上的fine-tuning方差分解。 Worst档中未执行——P1优先级，GPU\n    budget被P0消耗。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: NOT_COMPLETED\n    records_collected: 0\n    blocking_reason: 'P1 priority。P0实验（exp-001 ~100h + exp-002 ~200h + exp-003 ~60h\n      partial） 消耗了大部分GPU budget。1,728次fine-tuning runs × ~15min ≈ 430 GPU-hours 无法accommodate。\n\n      '\n  result_rationale: 'Per D006 framing directive #5，fine-tuning已降级为Discussion-section\n    preliminary observation，不是numbered contribution。即使完成，encoder-only RoBERTa的fine-tuning与decoder\n    LLM inference的methodological gap也会被 reviewer指出。在worst档reframed narrative（MMLU\n    case study + IRT comparison） 中，fine-tuning完全outside scope。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '零影响。在Discussion中mention \"extending G-theory to fine-tuning variance is\n    natural future work; Dodge et al. (2020) and Bui et al. (2025) provide preliminary\n    evidence that seed/LR dominate fine-tuning variance\"。\n\n    '\n- name: 'exp-007: LayerCast precision mitigation'\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: 'LayerCast（FP16 storage + FP32 compute）作为额外precision条件。 P2优先级，worst档中未执行。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: NOT_COMPLETED\n    records_collected: 0\n    blocking_reason: P2 priority, not attempted within AAAI timeline\n  result_rationale: 'LayerCast是mitigation strategy evaluation，不是core finding。 BF16-vs-FP16\n    sensitivity已显示precision effect=0.0006%（接近zero）， LayerCast的additional data point价值marginal——precision已经不是\n    variance source。可以在Discussion中cite Yuan et al. (2025)的 LayerCast results as \"practitioners\n    can further reduce precision variance via mixed-precision strategies\"。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '零影响。Precision在bf16/fp16上已经是non-issue（0.0006%）， LayerCast实验变得moot。\n\n    '\n- name: 'exp-008: MATH benchmark extension'\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: 'MATH benchmark（200 items）测试reasoning-heavy任务的variance structure。 P2优先级且deps\n    on exp-002，worst档中未执行。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: NOT_COMPLETED\n    records_collected: 0\n    blocking_reason: 'P2 priority。Deps on exp-002 pipeline（已完成但consumed timeline）。\n      MATH的chain-of-thought generation需要significantly longer inference time （avg ~45\n      tokens vs MMLU ~1 token），200h GPU budget已用尽。\n\n      '\n  result_rationale: 'exp-002已经覆盖了GSM8K（math reasoning）、ARC（science reasoning）、 HellaSwag（commonsense），增加MATH的marginal\n    value在worst档flat gradient 下更低——不会出现新pattern，只会是another data point在38-44% item_id区间内。\n    如果需要bolster \"benchmark-insensitivity\" claim，现有4个benchmarks （MMLU + 3 from exp-002）已经sufficient。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: Marginal impact。4个benchmarks showing flat structure已经支撑 \"benchmark-insensitivity\"\n    reframe。MATH would be 5th data point but not change the conclusion。适合ACL ARR补充。\n","numLines":1054,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1054}}}
