{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SJfiY1nkCgT7D44ss5CC5F","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519/projects/nlp_variance_gtheory/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-21\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- exp002_multi_benchmark: Cross-benchmark variance gradient: item_id dominance systematically decreases from knowledge-retrieval (MMLU) to reasoning (GSM8K) benchmarks, and D-study reliability budgets are benchmark-conditional — supporting Claim 1 (benchmark gradient) and Claim 3 (benchmark-conditional budget). 4 models × 4 benchmarks × bf16 × 2 temps × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 4 orderings × 200 items = 921,600 records.（已分配 westd-32570 GPU:cuda:0,cuda:1,cuda:2,cuda:3，等待提交）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **exp001b_resampling** (success): Single-model item_id dominance (~58%) in G-theory decomposition is robust to item sampling — 3 independent 200-item stratified MMLU samples will show consistent item_id%, interaction percentages, and G_item (CV < 10%), ruling out that exp-001's findings are artifacts of the specific 200-item sample. Baseline comparison: Llama single-model 6-facet decomposition. ← 基于 exp001_llama\\\\n  [exp001b_resampling_gstudy](/api/workspace-files/projects/nlp_variance_gtheory/artifacts/exp001b_resampling/data/exp001b_resampling_gstudy.md)\\\\n- **exp001_qwen** (success): Qwen3-8B variance decomposition at full scale (1,296 conditions × 200 items) completes the 4-model design for cross-model G-theory analysis — tests whether item_id dominance and model×item interaction patterns hold with a 4th architecturally distinct model (Claim 1) ← 基于 exp001_llama\\\\n- **exp001_mistral** (success): Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3 variance decomposition at full scale (1,296 conditions × 200 items) will contribute to cross-model G-theory analysis — model-as-facet tests whether item_id dominance holds across architecturally diverse models (Claim 1) ← 基于 exp001_llama\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 7 / 负向 1 / 失败 0 / 共 8\\\\ntotal_records: 259200 →（近 3 次 success）\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestd-32570: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1884, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01P86NUJis8A2ACvuPa9SU6B","session_id":"891f265c-8c20-445c-964a-94d66c0b1d82","uuid":"3ab8ea9a-768f-4eea-b683-88bc229dd046","timestamp":"2026-05-21T08:50:07.566Z"}
