{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01C8TrFwzfC182RiXYXo5gb7","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tBF16-vs-FP16 Sensitivity Analysis (Dream #3 Response)\n2\t\n3\tData: 525,400 records, 3 models (Llama/Mistral/Qwen), BF16+FP16 only (no FP32)\n4\t\n5\tPrecision-related variance components:\n6\t| Component | 3-Precision (%) | BF16+FP16 (%) | Delta |\n7\t|---|---|---|---|\n8\t| precision | 0.4033 | 0.0006 | -0.4027 |\n9\t| precision×item | 1.3036 | 0.0412 | -1.2623 |\n10\t| model×precision | 0.1995 | 0.0009 | -0.1986 |\n11\t\n12\tKey: FP32 is sole driver of precision variance. BF16≈FP16 (0.23pp diff).\n13\tFile on server: results/analysis/bf16_fp16_only_gstudy.json"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01HgqizP2Y57DeAR6wSkjoQc","session_id":"891f265c-8c20-445c-964a-94d66c0b1d82","uuid":"a2115cdd-3ef9-4be0-8f11-958172609621","timestamp":"2026-05-21T08:53:50.742Z"}
